<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:49:11 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hêêl Kaxay Jăng</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jăng</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jhn</para>
  <para style="mt">Jăng</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Kapa tep e Apok Xarooy, Apok Xarooy măn kung Kơy Plêêk, ji Apok Xarooy laa Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Kadraq heq e xing kapa tep dii Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Tôôy paroh gamưh Kadraq jah panưk pajêêk, ji tuôôy leh jah panưk pajêêk xing Kadraq, yôôych be muuyq paroh leq jah yuôôr vlôh. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Đom Kadraq laa varơuq riirh, ji varơuq riirh laa xaraar tađnah ku koot manih. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Xaraar tađnah ahnhe đom kamơng jaluk, ji kamơng jaluk be jay iaq xaraar tađnah.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />E muuyq dro jah patăk xing Kơy Plêêk, anơng ku kơy laa Jăng. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Kơy heq truh đom varơuq dơơp xanưk xôq kơy hnoq ik dơơp xanưk truh varơuq tađnah, xôq gamưh Kơy, tôôy dro hnoq ik tuôq. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Kadih kơy nưq leh aalq laa varơuq tađnah, bơh kơy heq truh xôq kơy dơơp xanưk truh varơuq tađnah. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Xaraar tađnah dik, laa xaraar tađnah ahnhe tađnah tôôy dro, heq truh đom dêh araak. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Kadraq heq măn đom dêh araak, ji dêh araak jah panưk pajêêk xing Kadraq, đơu dêh araak be 'yo xet Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Kadraq heq hooy truh aduq thuôk ku Kadraq, đơu tamooy thuôk ku Kadraq be đoonq nhonq Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Bơh dêq hloay khơl adro tuôq nhonq Kadraq, yôôych Kadraq kahniq ka oot qwuyen jah dơơp koot xau ku Kơy Plêêk, nưq laa khơl leq tuôq aduq yal Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Khơl adro nưq leh aalq jah pa iir vlôh xing vahaap, kung be xing xuum trôôch xăk xamơk, long xing iq koot manih, bơh laa xing Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Apok Xarooy heq vlôh jêêk xăk xamơk ji măn riirh katul haay. Ji haay heq 'yo hloq tađnah tađnaak ku Kadraq, dang đaji tađnah tađnaak ku Koot Muuyq truh xing Vaq, galơh galaay vanong plêêk kung dii varơuq dik. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Jăng dơơp xanưk truh kadraq ji kôt apok đnooy đaneq: “Neq laa Kơy đơu gô heq đnooy: ‘Kơy truh atêq gô heq vlôh jêêk kôt galơh iaq gô, vii Kadraq 'miêh heq e adroyq gô.’” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Vii gamưh xing varơuq xaleep ku Kadraq, dêq hloay haay nhonq xok dêq vanong plêêk neq truh vanong plêêk kadrơy. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Xing ganuun heq jah kahniq ăm gamưh Môi-se. Vanong plêêk ji varơuq dik heq truh gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Leh kơyq hmưq 'yo hloq Kơy Plêêk. Vơ muuyq Koot Muuyq Kơy Plêêk, Kơy măn đom xuum Vaq, jơq Kơy nưq kahnoq vlôh truh Vaq.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Neq laa apok xanưk ku Jăng tuôôy manih Jo Thaiq patăk khơl thơy tơơk tưp ji manih Lê-vi xing Jê-ru-sa-lem truh xôq vôôch kơy: “Kơy laa kơyq?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Kơy ăm xet đnooy hlolh — be laayq kadook đơu chiuq nhonq — đaneq: “Gô leh aalq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Oot vôôch kơy: “Nưq laa luleq? Kơy laa Ê-li be?” Kơy tơơl: “Gô leh aalq.” “Kơy laa Kơy hlit jơq be?” Kơy tơơl: “Lưp.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Yôôch anưq, oot đnooy dii kơy: “Kơy laa kơyq, xôq 'wot hnoq ik e apok tơơl hlê ka khơl adro heq patăk 'wot truh? Kơy đnooy kajoq truh kadih kơy?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Kơy tơơl:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Gô laa apok đnooy ahna tok đom wăngq we:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Dayh dơơp dong hyioh ngưưr trôôk ku Lôôk,’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">đaji hnhư hlit Ê-sai heq đnooy.” <verse eid="JHN 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Toleq dro jah patăk truh 'miêh thuôk bing ja manih Pha-ri-si, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />oot vôôch 'yo kơy, ji đnooy kung kơy: “Atoh kơy leh aalq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, kung be aalq Ê-li, long Hnhư Hlit, anưq yôôych aleq kơy dơơp bap-tem?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Jăng tơơl apok oot đaneq: “Gô đong dơơp bap-tem bơơn daak. Bơh Kơy heq dưk katul êêp kơy đơu êêp kơy leh xet, <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />laa Kơy truh atêq gô, Kơy đơu gô be xưngq đangq xôq tơq talơy vek kaxôôp ku Kadraq.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Kaluh varơuq nưq xalih vlôh aduq Bê-tha-ni pi hơq tavook daak Jô-đanh, aduq đơu Jăng 'miêh đong dơơp bap-tem. <verse eid="JHN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Hngơy atêq, Jăng hloq Lôôk Jê-xu hooy truh aduq kơy, yôôych đnooy đaneq: “'Yo hơq, Trưưu Koot ku Kơy Plêêk, Kơy xagook kadrôôp maroh ku dêh araak hooy! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Nưq laa truh Kơy nưq đơu gô heq đnooy: ‘Manih truh atêq gô laa Kơy 'miêh kôt galơh iaq gô, vii kadraq heq e adroyq gô.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Gô lưp xet Kadraq, bơh xôq Kadraq jah kahnoq vlôh ka manih I-sơ-ra-ên, gô truh dơơp bap-tem bơơn daak vii muk đich nưq.” <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Jăng heq dơơp xanưk, tuôôy đnooy đaneq: “Gô heq hloq Kơy Phool Hiel xing plêêk kahri pôôt đaji xêêp katrơu, ji găp tol Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Gô kung leh 'yo vlôh Kadraq, bơh Kơy patăk gô dơơp bap-tem bơơn daak, Kơy nưq xanoh dii gô: ‘Tol paq kê kơyq đơu koot hloq Kơy Phool Hiel kahri pôôt ji găp tol xăk, yôôych dro nưq laa Kơy dơơp bap-tem bơơn Kơy Phool Hiel.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Yôôch gô heq 'yo hloq ji dơơp xanưk đaneq neq laa Koot Kơy Plêêk.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Muuyq yưk tra, ka hngơy xatyauq nưq, Jăng đong dưk dii vaarq dro đom khơl xatyauq ku kơy, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />ji tuôôy hloq Lôôk Jê-xu hooy dalơh hlê, kơy đnooy: “'Yo hơq, Trưưu Koot ku Kơy Plêêk!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Vaarq dro khơl xatyauq nưq ku Jăng tameng đnooy đanưq yôôych oot hooy tyauq Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu wih hlê ji hloq oot đong hooy tyauq Kadraq, Kadraq vôôch oot: “Êêp ay axek kơyq?” Oot tơơl apok Kadraq: “Ra-bi (apok neq jah jich iq laa ‘Thơy’), Thơy đong măn ka'leq?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Dayh truh yôôch oh ay hnoq hloq.” Anưq laa oot hooy, hloq aduq Kadraq đong măn, ji oot heq măn hlê dii Kadraq ka hngơy nưq. Tuôôy nưq laa đom kawah wat thưq kưl. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Muuyq đom vaarq dro heq tameng xing Jăng ji hooy tyauq Lôôk Jê-xu laa Anh-rê, oh kanau ku Si-môn Phi-e-rơ. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Adroyq dik, kơy axek tavơh ay ku kơy laa Si-môn yôôch taboon hlê dii ay, đaneq: “'Wot oh heq tavơh Kơy Jah Para Jơu” (apok neq jah jich laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Kơy jarooy ay kơy truh dii Lôôk Jê-xu. Atêq tuôôy 'yo Kơy, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Ay laa Si-môn koot ku Jăng. Ay hnoq jah taayh laa Sê-pha” (anơng nưq jah jich vlôh apok laa “Phi-e-rơ”).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Hngơy atêq, Lôôk Jê-xu xung hooy chuh aduq nưq hooy truh Ga-li-lê, ji Kadraq axek tavơh Phi-lip yôôch dăt Kơy: “Dayh tyauq Thơy.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Phi-lip ji adro truh xing Bêt-sai-đa, nưq laa xing theng ku Anh-rê ji Phi-e-rơ. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Phi-lip axek tavơh Na-tha-na-ên ji đnooy dii kơy: “'Wot đơu axek jah xet Kơy đơu Môi-se heq valơk đom ganuun, ji khơl hlit kung anưq — laa Jê-xu, koot ku Jô-sep, xing Na-xa-ret.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Bơh Na-tha-na-ên tơơl hlê kơy: “Hnoq lưp e thưq kajoq tơơl dal vlôh xing Na-xa-ret ik ih?” Phi-lip đnooy kung kơy: “Dayh truh ji 'yo” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Lôôk Jê-xu hloq Na-tha-na-ên đong truh dii Kadraq, yôôych Kadraq đnooy truh kơy: “'Yo nee, muuyq dro I-sơ-ra-ên dong dik, be e varơuq pa ôôh lar măn đom adro neq!” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Na-tha-na-ên vôôch Kadraq: “Xing leq Thơy xet gô?” Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl, Kadraq đnooy kung kơy đaneq: “Adroyq tuôôy Phi-lip taayh ay, tuôôy đong măn 'laarq ưk pok puut, yôôych Thơy heq hloq ay.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Na-tha-na-ên tơơl kung Kadraq: “Ra-bi, Thơy laa Koot Kơy Plêêk! Thơy laa Vuua ku I-sơ-ra-ên!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê ji đnooy dii kơy: “Jơq be ay tuôq vii Thơy heq đnooy dii ay đaneq: ‘Thơy heq hloq ay 'laarq ưk pok puut’? Ay hnoq hloq kaluh varơuq kôt akêh iaq luneq đnoyq.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii kơy: “Dong dik, dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, oh ay hnoq hloq plêêk luh vlôh, ji yaak plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk tok pôôt tol Koot Manih.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Muut hngơy thưq pe, muuyq waal pajêêk dơơp vlôh aduq Ka-na, dêh Ga-li-lê, miq ku Lôôk Jê-xu măn aduq nưq. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Lôôk Jê-xu ji khơl xatyauq Kadraq kung jah mơơy truh waal pajêêk. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Tuôôy lok kateh dêq, miq ku Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii Kadraq: “Oot paq măn e lok.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Ji Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii mo: “Nee mo, varơuq nưq e apiq kajoq truh koot ji miq? Wat ku koot koq truh.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Miq ku Kadraq đnooy dii khơl xapok: “Dayh dơơp tyauq paq kê varơuq kajoq đơu ay nưq patăk êêp ay.” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Măn đnư e drơu poop xaroot bơơn phơu jah xôq đêh ka varơuq 'nhau xarêh ku manih Jo Thaiq, tôôy poop tađnưk jah đom kơh vaarq truh pe hlưk daak. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Lôôk Jê-xu dăt oot: “Dayh kliik viik daak muut kaluh xaroot nưq.” Yôôch oot kliik viik xaroot dong truh 'ngưh. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Juneq dayh muk vlôh ji taway truh ka adro kôôch waal.” Anưq laa, oot taway hooy. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Bơh tuôôy adro dưk 'yo waal liaah thưq daak heq jah vlôh jêêk lok (đơu kơy be xet ni e xing leq, măn khơl xapok — laa khơl adro heq muk daak nưq — yôôych xet), adro dưk 'yo waal taayh ok truh <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />ji đnooy dii ay: “Tôôy dro 'ngưng adoot lok lăp adroyq, ji tuôôy manih hooy heq hôôch vuul, yôôych adoot lok leh mach baak iaq. Măn ay yôôych jư lok lăp truh hloay juneq.” <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Neq laa dơuq akêh adroyq dik Lôôk Jê-xu heq dơơp aduq Ka-na, dêh Ga-li-lê, Kadraq kahnoq vlôh tađnah tađnaak ku Kadraq, ji khơl xatyauq Kadraq heq tuôq aduq Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Atêq varơuq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu, miq Kadraq ji khơl ma oh kanau, kung khơl xatyauq Kadraq hooy aloh truh theng Ka-bê-na-um, bơh oot măn đnư leh 'ngưng hngơy.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Lêh Dalơh Hlê ku manih Jo Thaiq heq jeq truh, yôôych Lôôk Jê-xu hooy tok truh Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Kadraq hloq đom hnhư hơu khơl adro tek bo, trưưu ji xêêp katrơu, kung khơl tađôôy jêêt đong 'ngôôy kađnư. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Atêq tuôôy voot muuyq poop rooy bơơn talơy, Kadraq pađuôôy dêq bing oot vlôh klơlh hnhư hơu, kung dii trưưu ji bo. Kadraq kung qweek pachaay jêêt ku khơl tađôôy jêêt ji taluq kahlôôp para ku oot. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Kadraq đnooy dii khơl adro tek xêêp katrơu: “Dayh xagook kaluh thưq nưq vlôh klơlh đnen. Te dơơp hnhư Vaq ku gô jêêk aduq tabôôt tek.” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Khơl xatyauq Kadraq văch hlê apok heq valơk, đaneq: “Xuum talăng jăk ka hnhư Lôôk hnoq vuh huur koot.” <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Vii kơq nưq, manih Jo Thaiq heq tơơl hlê ji đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kơy kahnoq ka 'wot hloq dơuq akêh kajoq tuôôy kơy dơơp kaluh varơuq neq?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Dayh pahyaak ka'lăk hnhư hơu neq, yôôch đom pe hngơy gô hnoq panưk ni hlê.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Anưq laa, manih Jo Thaiq đnooy: “Hnhư hơu neq jah dơơp đom poot kưl drơu xanưm, đơu kơy hnoq panưk ni hlê đom pe hngơy?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Lunư, hnhư đơu Kadraq đong đnooy truh đnooy truh hnhư hơu ku xăk xamơk Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Vii anưq, tuôôy Kadraq heq xing aduq kaxêêt riirh hlê, khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq văch hlê đaneq Kadraq heq đnooy đanưq, yôôych oot tuôq Rahlăp Vah ji apok đơu Lôôk Jê-xu heq đnooy.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Mot kadrơy, đom tuôôy Kadraq măn aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem muut katuôôy Lêh Dalơh Hlê, đom tuôôy lêh, 'ngưng dro tuôq aduq yal Kadraq tuôôy hloq kaluh dơuq akêh đơu Kadraq heq dơơp. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Bơh anưq, kadih Lôôk Jê-xu leh deng xuum tuôq kơy ka oot, vii Kadraq xet dêq hloay tôôy dro, <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />nưq laa Kadraq be e kơn duh pheq đnooy kơyq nưq pheq dơơp xanưk ka khơl kadrơy, vii Kadraq kadih xet varơuq kajoq măn đom tôôy dro.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Anưq bơh, e muuyq adro thuôk bing Pha-ri-si, muuyq dro dưk xakaq ku tamooy Jo Thaiq, anơng kơy laa Ni-kô-đem. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Kơy neq truh tavơh Lôôk Jê-xu muut ka klôôy, ji đnooy dii Kadraq: “Thơy lơơy, 'wot xet đaneq Thơy laa thơy pato truh xing Kơy Plêêk, vii be e adro leq hnoq ik dơơp vlôh kaluh dơuq akêh neq, laa kaluh kajoq Thơy dưk dơơp, atoh Kơy Plêêk leh măn kung adro nưq.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê ji đnooy kung kơy: “Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii kơy, atoh kơyq leh jah pa iir hlê, yôôych adro nưq hnoq leh hloq ik daak dêh ku kơy plêêk.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Ni-kô-đem tơơl dii Kadraq: “Dơơp aleq muuyq adro, tuôôy laa muuyq kơy karaq, hnoq ik pa iir vlôh? Dang aleq adro nưq hnoq ik muut đom klaak miq ni yưk thưq vaarq yôôch jah pa iir vlôh ih?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl: “Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii kơy, atoh dro leq leh jah pa iir vlôh xing daak ji Kơy Phool Hiel, yôôych dro nưq leh ik muut đom daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Varơuq Kajoq jah pa iir xing xăk xamơk laa xăk xamơk, ji varơuq Kajoq jah pa iir xing Kơy Phool Hiel laa yaak. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Te tưng hưng tuôôy gô heq đnooy dii kơy: ‘Varơuq duh dik ka kơy laa jah pa iir hlê.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Khiel klôôp aduq leq ni trôôch, ji kơy tek ik hnưm ku ni, bơh kơy be xet khiel truh xing leq long khiel hooy truh leq. Yôôych kung đanưq đôôyq dii paq kê kơyq jah pa iir vlôh xing Kơy Phool Hiel.” <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Ni-kô-đem tơơl đnoyq ji vôôch Kadraq: “Dơơp aleq varơuq nưq hnoq ik xalih vlôh ik?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê ji đnooy dii kơy: “Kơy laa Thơy pato ku manih I-sơ-ra-ên đơu kơy leh hlolh kaluh varơuq nưq ih? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii kơy đaneq 'wot đnooy truh varơuq đơu 'wot heq xet, ji 'wot dơơp xanưk truh varơuq đơu 'wot heq hloq, măn êêp kơy leh nhonq xok apok xanưk ku 'wot. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Atoh gô heq đnooy ka êêp kơy truh kaluh varơuq 'laarq vari đơu êêp kơy măn leh tuôq, yôôych dơơp aleq êêp kơy hnoq tuôq atoh gô đnooy ka êêp kơy truh kaluh varơuq tol plêêk? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Be kơyq hmưq tok tol plêêk đêh vlôh Kơy heq kahri pôôt xing plêêk — nưq laa Koot Manih. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Môi-se heq kađnok volh atok đom wăngq we đaji luleq, yôôych Koot Manih duh pheq biq kađnok tok đaji lunưq, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />xôq tôôy dro tuôq muut Kadraq raay e varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Vii Kơy Plêêk thier xung xiaq dêh araak, pheq dơơp Kadraq kahniq Koot muuyq ku Kadraq, xôq ka dêq hloay adro tuôq muut Koot nưq leh biq kaxêêt hlơơp, bơh e jah varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Bơyh Kơy Plêêk leh patăk Koot muut dêh araak xôq xưh xadrah dêh araak, bơh xôq wơơt dêh araak gamưh Koot nưq. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Adro tuôq aduq Koot nưq yôôych leh biq rôp kadrôôp, măn kơyq leh tuôq yôôych heq biq rôp kadrôôp yôôch, vii heq leh tuôq truh yal Koot Muuyq ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Mot kadrơy, neq laa varơuq rôp xadrah, nưq laa: xaraar tađnah heq muut đom dêh araak, bơh khơl drơy xiaq trôôch kamơng jaluk iaq xaraar tađnah vii kaluh varơuq dơơp ku oot laa xơk aak. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Vii tôôy dro dơơp xơk yôôych 'yarơ xaraar tađnah, ji leh truh dii xaraar tađnah, xôq ka kaluh varơuq dơơp ku oot be huq biq kahnoq vlôh. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Lunư, adro dơơp varơuq dong dik yôôych truh dii xaraar tađnah, xôq kaluh varơuq ku dro nưq jah kahnoq vlôh đaneq oot jah dưk dơơp đom Kơy Plêêk.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu ji khơl xatyauq Kadraq hooy muut dêh Ju-đê. Kadraq măn hlê aduq nưq dii oot ji dơơp bap-tem. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Lunư, Jăng kung đong dơơp bap-tem aduq At-nôn jeq Sa-lim, vii aduq nưq e 'ngưng daak, manih karôp garuk truh ji chiuq bap-tem — <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Vii Jăng 'miêh koq biq rôp karuk tu. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Anưq laa, muuyq varơuq tayaat tagêh xalih vlôh vlôh xing khơl xatyauq ku Jăng kung dii muuyq adro manih Jo Thaiq truh ka varơuq lêh 'nhaau xarêh. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Yôôch oot truh dii Jăng ji đnooy kung kơy: “Ra-bi, adro heq hmưq măn dii thơy pi hơq tavook daak Jô-đanh, đơu thơy heq dơơp xanưk truh dro nưq, dayh 'yo hơ, kơy nưq đong dơơp bap-tem, ji dêq hloay manih karôp đong garuk truh dii kơy nưq.” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Jăng tơơl hlê ji đnooy: “Khơl drơy leh ik nhonq jah kajoq, muuyq varơuq kung leh, atoh be aalq nưq laa varơuq heq jah kahniq ka dro nưq xing plêêk. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Kadih oh ay dơơp xanưk ka gô đaneq gô heq đnooy: ‘Gô leh aalq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh,’ bơh nưq laa ‘gô laa adro jah patăk truh kangưưr Kơy nưq.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Kơyq pajêêk amưưy yôôych laa ok. Măn 'wơyq ku ok, laa adro dưk ji tameng 'yo ok, yôôch xuum hươngh xuum hlah hlaak vii apok ku ok. Lunưq, xuum hlah hlaak nưq ku gô heq jah xaleep. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Varơuq pheq dơơp đôôyq dii Kơy nưq laa vanê tơơk tok, măn đôôyq dii gô laa apôôt pôôt.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Kơy truh xing ataalh yôôych măn ataalh dêq hloay. Adro vlôh xing vari yôôych thuôk ku vari ji đnooy kaluh varơuq thuôk ku vari. Kơy truh xing plêêk yôôych măn ataalh dêq hloay. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Kadraq dơơp xanưk truh varơuq đơu Kadraq heq hloq ji tameng, bơh be kơyq tuôq xok apok xanưk ku Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Adro heq nhonq xok apok xanưk ku Kadraq yôôch tuôq nhonq đaneq Kơy Plêêk laa dong dik. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Bơyh Kơy đơu Kơy Plêêk heq patăk truh yôôych đnooy apok ku Kơy Plêêk. Vii Kadraq kahniq ăm Kơy Phool Hiel tyauq trôôk leh e gah. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Vaq xung xiaq Koot ji heq pahnăp tôôy varơuq muut ti Koot. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Kơyq tuôq aduq Koot yôôych e varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, măn kơyq be tuôq Koot hnoq be hloq varơuq riirh, bơh đơơt tôq jaraq ku Kơy Plêêk kưq măn tol adro nưq.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Atêq nưq, tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu xet varơuq laa manih pha-ri-si heq tameng đaneq Kadraq lâp vlôh ji dơơp bap-tem ka 'ngưng khơl xatyauq iaq Jăng <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(long tabơh leh aalq kadih Lôôk Jê-xu dơơp pheep bap-tem, đơu laa khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq), <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />yôôych Kadraq chuh klơlh Ju-đê ji hooy xuq hlê Ga-li-lê. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Bơh varơuq nưq pheq băt Kadraq pheq hooy hlê Sa-ma-ri. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Nưq laa Kadraq hooy truh muuyq palơy dêh đom dêh Sa-ma-ri taayh laa Si-kha, jeq aduq vari đơu Ja-kôp heq ahlook ka Jô-sep, koot kanau kơy. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Aduq neq e jiêng ku Ja-kôp. Tuôôy nưq, vii Lôôk Jê-xu heq galeh galal vii hooy trôôk xangưưy, Kadraq 'ngôôy ka gah jiêng. Tuôôy nưq muut đom kawah wat thưq drơu. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Muuyq dro khơl kadrê đom dêh Sa-ma-ri truh xôq muk daak, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii mư: “Xiin ăm gô hôôch daak.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Vii khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq heq hooy muut đom dêh palơy xôq oot hnoq ik root tuôông xa. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Anưq yôôch mư kadrê Sa-ma-ri đnooy kung Kadraq: “Dơơp aleq kơy, laa muuyq manih Jo Thaiq, xet vôôch hôôch daak xing gô, laa muuyq dro khơl drê Sa-ma-ri?” (Vii manih Jo Thaiq leh jeq athêêk dii manih Sa-ma-ri.) <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl, ji Kadraq đnooy dii mư: “Atoh mư heq 'yo xet kadrool ku Kơy Plêêk, ji kơyq laa manih đong đnooy dii mư: ‘Xiin ăm gô hôôch daak,’ yôôych mư heq hnoq vôôch manih nưq, ji manih nưq heq hnoq kahniq ka mư daak riirh.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mư kadrê đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kơy lơơy, kơy leh e kajoq xôq muk, ji jiêng yôôych jaruq. Anưq, xing leq đơu kơy e daak riirh nưq? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Dang aleq laa kơy kôt iaq Ja-kôp, mo kơy 'wot, kơy heq xôq ka 'wot jiêng neq, đơu xing kadih ni, kơy heq hôôch kung dii koot xau kơy ji kaluh ôô ku kơy?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl ji Kadraq đnooy ka mư: “Paq kê kơyq hôôch aduq daak jiêng neq hnoq laay thaal, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />bơh long kơyq hôôch aduq daak đơu gô ăm hnoq paq 'leq thaal đnoyq dong truh đơơy đơơy. Tađôôy muut đnư, daak đơu gô ăm hnoq jêêk vlôh alook daak đom dro nưq nưưng galaay truh varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mư kadrê đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kơy lơơy, xiin ăm ka gô daak nưq xôq gô paq huq thaal, ji paq huq duh truh đnen xok daak.” <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Kadraq dăt mư: “Dayh hooy, taayh kanau mư ji wiit hlê đnen.” <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mư kadrê tơơl hlê, ji mư đnooy dii Kadraq: “Gô leh e kanau.” Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl ka mư: “Mư đnooy thier jơq đaneq: ‘Gô leh e kanau,’ <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Vii mư heq e dăp dro kanau, ji adro đơu mư đong e yôôych leh aalq laa kanau mư! Apok mư đnooy laa dik!” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mư kadrê nưq đnooy dii kadraq: “Kơy lơơy, gô hloq đaneq kơy laa muuyq hnhư hlit. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Mo kơy 'wot ayuôôt laat tol đoot neq, măn êêp kơy đnooy đaneq aduq đơu khơl drơy pheq ayuôôt laat laa aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii mư: “Nee mư, dayh tuôq gô, đaneq wat jeq truh, laa tuôôy khơl êêp hnoq ayuôôt laat Vaq leh aalq tol đoot neq, kung be aalq aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Khơl êêp ayuôôt laat varơuq êêp leh xet. 'Wot ayuôôt laat varơuq 'wot xet, vii varơuq wơơt xok laa xing manih Jo Thaiq. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Lunư, wat jeq truh, ji heq đong truh, tuôôy khơl adro ayuôôt laat dong dik hnoq ayuôôt laat Vaq bơơn danưng kooy ji varơuq dik, vii Vaq kung axek khơl adro đanưq, laa khơl adro ayuôôt laat Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Kơy Plêêk laa Yaak, atoh kơyq ayuôôt laat Kadraq pheq ayuôôt laat bơơn danưng kooy ji varơuq dik.” <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mư kadrê đnooy dii Kadraq đaneq: “Gô xet Kơy Jah Para Jơu (Kơy jah taayh laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh) xarôp truh. Tuôôy Kadraq truh, kadih kadraq hnoq đnooy vlôh tôôy varơuq ka 'wot.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl dii mư: “Jơq laa gô, manih đong đnooy athêêk dii mư.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl xatyauq Kadraq wiit xuq, ji oot hloq akêh vii Kadraq đong đnooy athêêk dii muuyq dro khơl kadrê. Long anưq, leh e kơyq vôôch: “Thơy axek kajoq nưq?” long: “Vii aleq Thơy đnooy athêêk dii mư nưq?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Anưq yôôch, mư kadrê ka'lăk hlê wo daak ku ni, mư wiit muut đom palơy dêh, ji đnooy dii manih karôp: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Dayh truh, tavơh muuyq dro, đơu dro nưq heq đnooy ka gô dêq hloay tôôy varơuq gô hmưq dơơp. Nưq be aalq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ih?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Oot garuk vlôh klơlh theng ji truh dii Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Đom kawah wat nưq, khơl xatyauq apôôy ratuut Kadraq, tơơl: “Ra-bi lơơy, xiin dayh xa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Bơh Kadraq đnooy kung oot: “Thơy e tuôông xôq xa đơu ay oh leh xet.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Lunưq, khơl xatyauq đnooy kung mamuuyq: “Dang leq kơyq nưq heq xagook truh ka thơy xa?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Tuôông xa ku thơy nưq laa thơy dưk dơơp iq trôôch ku Kơy patăk thơy ji payôôch varơuq dơơp ku Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Be aalq oh ay đnooy đaneq: ‘Măn poot xiêk tra, yôôch xiêk goch truh’ ih? Nee, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, dayh 'ngơơk mot oh ay tok ji 'yo kaluh manay va, vii oot đong drêêk 'miêh ka xiêk goch! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Manih goch nhonq jêêt hngơy ji goch xok raak play ka varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, xôq yôôch manih pêêt ji adro goch raay kung mamuuyq hlah hlaak. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Vii apok atêq neq dik jơq, đaneq: ‘Manih neq laa adro pêêt, ji adro kadrơy laa adro goch.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Thơy patăk dăt ay oh goch xok varơuq đơu ay oh leh duh pơơl hwơơl. Bơh khơl drơy heq pơơl hwơơl, măn ay oh tawaak muut xok varơuq vlôh va uh ku oot.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Tuôôy nưq, 'ngưng manih Sa-ma-ri đom palơy dêh nưq xôq xuum tuôq aduq Kadraq gamưh apok mư kadrê dơơp xanưk đaneq: “Kadraq đnooy dii gô tôôy varơuq đơu gô heq dơơp.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Lunưq tuôôy khơl manih Sa-ma-ri truh tavơh Kadraq, oot xiin Kadraq măn hlê dii oot, ji Kadraq măn hlê đnư vaarq hngơy. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Kơn athêêp 'ngưng dro tuôq vii apok ku Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Oot đnooy dii mư kadrê đaneq: “'Wot paq măn tuôq gamưh muut apok ku mư đnoyq, vii kadih 'wot heq tameng, ji 'wot heq xet đaneq manih neq jơq dik laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ku dêh araak.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Vaarq hngơy atêq, Kadraq hooy klơlh aduq nưq truh Ga-li-lê. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Vii kadih Lôôk Jê-xu heq đnooy hlolh đaneq muuyq hnhư hlit leh jah 'yo vado aduq dêh katu oot. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Lunưq, tuôôy Kadraq hooy truh Ga-li-lê, manih Ga-li-lê tiip đoonq Kadraq, vii hmưq hloq dêq hloay tôôy varơuq Kadraq heq dơơp aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem đom tôôy lêh, vii oot kung heq hooy jưq lêh. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq laay hooy truh Ka-na đom dêh Ga-li-lê, aduq đơu Kadraq heq dơơp daak jêêk lok, ji e muuyq padrok hnhư vuua hơq, koot kanau ku kơy đong biq jiq aduq Ka-bê-na-um. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Tuôôy tameng đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu xing Ju-đê heq xuq truh Ga-li-lê, kơy nưq truh tavơh Kadraq ji apôôy vôôch dong jah Kadraq hnoq ik hooy aloh ji payơh jiq ka koot kanau kơy, vii oh nưq jeq kaxêêt. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Anưq yôôch, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Atoh êêp kơy be hloq kaluh dơuq akêh ji kaluh varơuq taay yaak, yôôych êêp kajưk dik leh tuôq.” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Kơy padrok hnhư vuua đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kadraq lơơy, apôôy dayh aloh adroyq tuôôy koot gô kaxêêt.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Lôôk Jê-xu dăt kơy: “Dayh xuq yơu, Koot kanau kơy măn riirh.” Adro kơy neq tuôq apok đơu Lôôk Jê-xu heq đnooy dii kơy, ji kơy hooy xuq. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Đom tuôôy kơy đong hooy trôôk, khơl xapok ku kơy truh tavơh kơy ji đnooy hlê, tơơl đaneq koot kanau kơy đong măn riirh. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Anưq, Kơy vôôch 'yo aduq oot muut wat leq đơu oh de xarôp hloq kalh. Anưq laa oot tơơl kung kơy đaneq: “Hngơy ahnưh, muut wat thưq pơh, Jiq tanget hlơơp klơlh oh.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Gamưh anưq, adro vaq 'yo xet đaneq nưq laa muut kawat đơu Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Koot kanau kơy măn riirh.” Kadih kơy tuôq kung dii dêq kôôch hnhư kơy. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Măn Lôôk Jê-xu heq laay dưk dơơp dơuq akêh thưq vaarq neq, atêq katuôôy hooy xing Ju-đê truh Ga-li-lê.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, e muuyq đơơt lêh ku manih Jo Thaiq, ji Lôôk Jê-xu hooy tok truh theng Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Tuôôy nưq, aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, pi 'Mok Trưưu, e muuyq hlôôk daak, jah taayh laa Bêt-têt-đa, đom apok Hi-baq-lai. E dăp gok voom apo đơ. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Muuyq bing karôp khơl adro jiq bingq, apul, atul tâk, taqwauq talêêt đong vik aduq kaluh aduq voom đơ neq. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />[Vii muuyq kơy yaak ku Lôôk, muut muuyq kawat leq nưq, kahri pôôt hlôôk daak ji awơq lăngq laq daak, lunưq adro leq tawaak pôôt adroyq dik tuôôy daak lăngq laq yôôch jah yơh, long tavơh bingq đaji luleq tuôôy nưq.] <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Măn đnư e muuyq ay hơq, heq biq pe kưl thơơm xanưm riirh đom jiq jiêh ku ni. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu hloq adro neq đong vik kađnư, ji xet đaneq ay neq heq măn đnư đom muuyq kawat thier xiik yôôch, Kadraq đnooy kung ay: “Ay trôôch jah yơh be?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Manih jiq tơơl apok Kadraq: “Thơy lơơy, gô leh e kơyq xôq tuôôy daak lăngq laq yôôch adro nưq hnoq ik tapôôk gô pôôt hlôôk daak. Mot kadrơy, đom tuôôy gô đong hooy pôôt hlôôk, yôôch dro kadrơy kưq pôôt adroyq gô.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Lôôk Jê-xu dăt ay: “Dayh dưk tok, hlôôy chanưng ku ay tok ji tawaak hooy.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Hloay jơnưq, adro khơl kanau nưq vlôh kalh paraat yơh hloay, ay hlôôy chanưng ay tok, ji tawaak hooy.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Hngơy nưq laa hngơy Sa-bat. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Nưq laa manih Jo Thaiq đnooy dii dro heq jah payơh: “Hngơy neng laa hngơy Sa-bat, ji leh ăm pheep ay hlôôy chanưng ay.” <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Bơh ay tơơl hlê oot: “Manih heq dơơp ka gô kalh paraat, kadih dro nưq dăt gô: ‘Dayh hlôôy chanưng ay tok ji tawaak hooy.’” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Oot vôôch ay: “Kơyq laa manih heq dăt ay ‘Dayh hlôôy chanưng tok ji tawaak hooy’?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Lunư, dro jah payơh leh xet nưq laa kơyq, vii Lôôk Jê-xu heq hooy valah muut manih karôp đong e mot aduq nưq. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu axek tavơh ay đom hnhư hơu ji Kadraq đnooy dii ay: “Nee, ay heq jah kalh paraat yôôch! Te lôp kadrôôp đnoyq, xôq ka varơuq pơơl hwơơl iaq leh xalih truh ka ay.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Adro khơl kanau neq vlôh hooy ji taboon dii manih Jo Thaiq đaneq nưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu, manih heq dơơp ka gô kalh paraat. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Vii kơq nưq, manih Jo Thaiq rôp toop Lôôk Jê-xu, vii Kadraq heq dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq nưq đom hngơy Sa-bat. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Bơh Kadraq tơơl hlê oot: “Vaq Gô đong măn dơơp varơuq dong truh juneq, gô kung dơơp varơuq đanưq.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Vii apok neq, lunưq manih Jo Thaiq laay kơn axek kach păk kaxêêt Kadraq vii Kadraq leh hloh lôp kadrôôp hngơy Sa-bat, đơu măn taayh Kơy Plêêk laa Vaq kadraq, kadih dơơp ka kadraq xađong raa dii Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Lunưq, Lôôk Jê-xu heq tơơl hlê ji đnooy kung oot: “Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii êêp kơy, Koot leh ik kadih xăk ni xôq dơơp paq kê varơuq kajoq, đêh vlôh varơuq kajoq đơu Koot hloq Vaq dơơp, vii paq kê varơuq kajoq Vaq dơơp yôôych kaluh varơuq nưq Koot kung dơơp đanưq. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Vii Vaq xiaq Koot ji kahnoq ka Koot tôôy varơuq đơu kadih Vaq dơơp, lunưq Kadraq kahnoq vlôh ka Koot kaluh varơuq kôt iaq đanưq đnoyq xôq êêp kơy pheq dơơp akêh. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Vii Vaq khienq manih kaxêêt riirh hlê ji kahniq ka oot varơuq riirh đaleq, yôôych Koot kung kahniq varơuq riirh ka adro leq Koot trôôch đanưq. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Vii pheq đnooy Vaq kung leh xưh xadrah kơyq, bơh Kadraq heq ăm xaleep qwuyen xưh xadrah ka Koot, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />xôq tôôy dro kul vado Koot đaji oot kul vado Vaq. Kơyq leh kul vado Koot yôôych leh kul vado Vaq, laa Kơy heq patăk dăt Koot. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii êêp kơy, nưq laa kơyq tameng apok gô ji tuôq Kơy patăk dăt gô yôôych jah varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, ji adro nưq be hooy truh varơuq xưh xadrah, bơh heq dalơh klơlh varơuq kaxêêt xôq truh varơuq riirh. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii êêp kơy đaneq kawat jeq truh, ji tuôôy nưq laa tuôôy đơu manih kaxêêt hnoq tameng apok ku Koot Kơy Plêêk, ji adro leq tameng hnoq riirh. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Vii Vaq e varơuq riirh đom Kadraq đaleq, yôôych Vaq kung kahniq ka Koot xôq e varơuq riirh đom Koot đanưq, <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />ji Vaq heq kahniq ka Koot qwuyen dưk dơơp varơuq xưh xadrah vii Koot laa Koot Manih. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Te tưng hưng truh varơuq neq, vii hnoq truh kawat đơu muut tuôôy nưq, tôôy dro đom xanưng hnoq tameng apok ku Kadraq, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />ji oot hnoq hooy vlôh pi gôk — adro leq heq dơơp varơuq kaxay yôôych wih truh varơuq riirh hlê ka varơuq riirh, măn adro leq heq dơơp varơuq xơk yôôych wih truh varơuq riirh hlê ka varơuq xưh xadrah.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Gô leh ik gamưh aduq kadih gô xôq dơơp paq kê varơuq kajoq. Gô xưh xadrah tyauq đaji gô tameng, ji varơuq xưh xadrah ku gô laa hyioh jăk vii gô leh axek iq trôôch đêh ku gô, bơh laa iq trôôch ku Kơy patăk dăt gô. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Atoh gô kadih dơơp xanưk ka gô, yôôych apok xanưk ku gô laa leh đangq tuôq. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />E muuyq dro kadrơy, laa adro dơơp xanưk truh gô, ji gô xet đaneq apok xanưk đơu adro nưq đnooy truh gô laa dong dik. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Êêp kơy heq patăk manih truh tavơh Jăng, ji Jăng heq dơơp xanưk ka varơuq dik. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Long gô leh nhonq apok xanưk xing koot manih, bơh gô đnooy kaluh varơuq neq laa xôq êêp kơy hnoq ik jah wơơt. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Jăng 'miêh laa gooy đeen đong jaq ji xaraar tađnah, măn êêp kơy heq trôôch hlah hlaak aduq xaraar tađnah ku kơy nưq đom muuyq kawat. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Bơh gô e apok xanưk kôt iaq apok xanưk ku Jăng: nưq laa kaluh varơuq đơu Vaq heq pahnăp ka gô xôq gô dơơp xaleep oot — nưq laa kaluh varơuq đơu gô dưk dơơp — dơơp xanưk truh gô đaneq Vaq heq patăk dăt gô. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Jơq Vaq, Kơy patăk dăt gô heq dơơp xanưk truh gô. Êêp kơy koq hmưq yưk leq tameng apok Kadraq, kung koq hmưq 'yo hloq muh mot Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Êêp kơy be e apok Kadraq măn hloay đom êêp, vii Kơy đơu Kadraq heq patăk dăt, yôôych êêp kơy leh e xuum tuôq aduq Kơy nưq. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Êêp kơy 'yo hooy 'yo hlê Rahlăp Vah vii êêp kơy biit gamưh nưq yôôych e varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, đơu kaluh apok nưq laa kaluh apok dơơp xanưk truh gô, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />ji êêp kơy leh trôôch truh dii gô xôq e jah varơuq riirh. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Gô be nhonq xok tađnah tađnaak xing aduq khơl drơy, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />lunư, gô xet truh êêp kơy đaneq xuum xung xiaq Kơy Plêêk be e đom êêp kơy. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Gô heq truh đom yal Vaq gô, ji êêp kơy be tiip nhonq gô. Bơh atoh dro leq truh bơơn yal đêh ku ni, yôôych êêp kơy tiip nhonq dro nưq. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Dơơp đaleq êêp kơy hnoq ik tuôq, tuôôy đong jư xok tađnah tađnaak xing dro kadrơy ji leh axek akhiim tađnah tađnaak truh xing Kơy Plêêk muuyq heq? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Te biit đaneq kadih gô hnoq rôp kadrôôp êêp kơy kangưưr Vaq. Manih rôp kadrôôp êêp kơy laa Môi-se, manih đơu êêp kơy xôq takôô gamưh muut. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Vii Atoh êêp kơy tuôq Môi-se, yôôych êêp kơy hnoq laa tuôq gô, nưq laa jo kơy nưq heq valơk truh gô. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Bơh atoh êêp kơy leh tuôq kaluh apok heq valơk ku kơy nưq, yôôych dơơp aleq đơu êêp kơy hnoq tuôq apok gô?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu dưk hooy hlê gah pi hơq ku daak tahli Ga-li-lê (laa dêh Ti-bê-ri-at). <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Muuyq bing manih thier karôp hooy tyauq Kadraq, vii oot hmưq 'yo hloq kaluh pheep akêh đơu Kadraq dưk dơơp tol khơl adro jiq jiêh. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu hooy tok tol đoot, ji aduq nưq Kadraq 'ngôôy pôôt kung dii khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />(Tuôôy nưq, Lêh Dalơh Hlê, tuôôy lêh ku manih Jo Thaiq, heq jeq truh.) <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Atêq nưq, tuôôy 'ngơơk mot tok ji hloq đaneq manih karôp thier karôp đong garuk truh kung Kadraq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii Phi-lip: “Haay hnoq ik root tôôp aduq leq xôq khơl adro neq xa?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />(Bơh Kadraq vôôch anưq xôq thưh kơy, vii Kadraq heq xet varơuq Kadraq xung dơơp.) <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Phi-lip tơơl hlê Kadraq: “Vaarq hreek đơ-ni-ê tôôp kung be đu ka oot xôq tôôy dro hnoq ik nhonq muuyq axit.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Anh-rê, muuyq đom khơl xatyauq Kadraq, ma oh kanau ku Si-môn Phi-e-rơ, tơơl dii Kadraq: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Măn đnen e muuyq ôn de đơu ôn nưq e dăp poop tôôp va away ji vaarq poop kaa, bơh kaluh tuôông neq e đol kajoq taso dii sôôq manih thier karôp?” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Dayh 'yo dăt manih karôp 'ngôôy pôôt.” (Tuôôy nưq e 'ngưng rek măn aduq nưq.) Anưq, khơl kanau 'ngôôy pôôt, sôôq kơh dăp ravơu. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Xatyauq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu adrơk kaluh poop tôôp ji atêq tuôôy tưp apok kuh kway, Kadraq ahlook ka khơl adro đong 'ngôôy xa, ji kung dơơp đanưq dii kaa, kơyq trôôch taleq kung ik. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Yôôch tuôôy manih karôp heq phiq phơh, Kadraq dăt khơl xatyauq kadraq: “Dayh tôôch anguk kaluh tapleh măn rah, xôq leh e thưq kajoq biq ka'lăk alay.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Anưq oot tôôch anguk ji xôq viik kưl vaarq vuk atar tôôp tapleh măn raah hlê xing dăp poop tôôp va away đơu manih karôp heq xa. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Kơq nưq, khơl manih jah hloq pheep akêh Kadraq heq dơơp, đnooy đaneq: “Neq jơq laa Kơy hlit pheq truh đom dêh araak.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Anưq, vii 'yo xet đaneq oot xung truh ji băt ahnen kadraq xôq vanê tok dơơp vuua, lunưq Lôôk Jê-xu laay wiit tok ma đoot muuyq dro.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy plêêk rayôôp klôôy, khơl xatyauq Kadraq hooy aloh vlôh pi daak tahli, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />yôôch tuôôy heq tawaak muut ge, oot hooy tapa hlê pi hơq tahli xôq truh Ka-bê-na-um, ji plêêk heq vlôh kamơng jaluk yôôch, đơu Lôôk Jê-xu kung koq truh dii oot. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Vii muuyq đơơt khiel kalh klôôp hlê, lunưq daak tahli kapuh ranaq. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Tuôôy heq awaayh jah đom kơh vaarq kưl dăp long pe kưl êch-ta-đơ, khơl xatyauq hloq Lôôk Jê-xu hooy jôôk tol raak daak ji truh jeq ge, anưq oot biq varaal hwaal. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Bơh Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Laa thơy neq! Te yôq.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Lunưq, oot xung taayh Kadraq tok ge, hloay juneq ge ngưh muut ka gah, aduq oot đong hooy truh.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Hngơy atêq, manih karôp 'miêh đong măn ka gah tahli piik nưq hloq đaneq đêh vlôh muuyq poop ge yôôych be e ge leq kadrơy măn đnư, ji hloq đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu heq leh muut đom ge dii khơl xatyauq Kadraq, đơu vơ e khơl xatyauq Kadraq chuh hooy. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Lunư, kaluh ge kadrơy heq truh xing Ti-bê-ri-at jeq aduq đơu oot heq xa tôôp atêq tuôôy Lôôk heq kuh kway. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Anưq, tuôôy manih karôp hloq đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu leh măn đnư, khơl xatyauq kadraq kung leh, yôôych oot tawaak muut ge ji hooy truh Ka-bê-na-um axek Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="JHN 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Atêq tuôôy axek hloq Kadraq pi gah hơq tahli, oot vôôch Kadraq: “Ra-bi, Thơy truh đnen dong leq?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê oot ji Kadraq đnooy: “Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii oh ay, oh ay axek gô leh aalq vii oh ay heq jah hloq kaluh varơuq akêh, bơh vii oh ay heq xa tôôp ji jah phiq phơh. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Te dơơp varơuq vii tuôông xa klêq va ih, bơh vii tuôông xa măn hlê truh varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy đơu Koot Manih hnoq kahniq ka oh ay, vii Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq, heq đongq dơuq tol Kadraq.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Yôôch anưq oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “'wot duh dơơp varơuq kajoq xôq 'wot hnoq ik dưk dơơp varơuq dơơp ku Kơy Plêêk?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê ji Kadraq dăt oot: “Neq laa varơuq dơơp ku Kơy Plêêk, nưq laa oh ay xôq xuum tuôq gamưh aduq Kơy đơu Kadraq heq patăk truh.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Anưq, oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “Anưq yôôych thơy dơơp pheep akêh leq xôq 'wot hloq ji tuôq thơy? Thơy hnoq dơơp varơuq kajoq? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Mo kơy ku 'wot xa ma na đom wăngq we, đaji e valơk đaneq: ‘Kadraq kahniq ka oot tôôp xing plêêk xôq xa.’” <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yôôch Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê oot: “Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii oh ay, Môi-se leh hmưq kahniq ka oh ay tôôp xing plêêk, bơh Vaq gô kahniq ka oh ay tôôp dik xing plêêk. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Vii tôôp ku Kơy Plêêk laa tôôp xing plêêk pôôt ji kahniq varơuq riirh ka dêh araak.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Lunưq, oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “Thơy lơơy, apôôy kahniq ka 'wot tôôp nưq hloay hloay.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Gô laa tôôp ku varơuq riirh. Kơyq truh dii gô kajưk dik hnoq leh pangoot, ji kơyq tuôq gamưh aduq gô kajưk dik hnoq be thaal dong leq. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Bơh gô heq đnooy oh ay đaneq oh ay heq hloq gô đơu oh ay be tuôq. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Dêq hloay khơl leq đơu Vaq kahniq ka gô hnoq truh kung gô, ji adro truh dii gô, yôôych gô kajưk dik hnoq leh ka'lăk pi gôk. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Vii gô xing plêêk pôôt leh aalq xôq gô dơơp tyauq iq ku gô, bơh tyauq iq ku Kơy patăk dăt gô. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Bơh neq laa iq trôôch ku Kơy patăk dăt gô, nưq laa gô leh xôq hlơơp muuyq dro leq đom dêq hloay khơl adro đơu Vaq heq kahniq ka gô, bơh gô hnoq khienq adro nưq riirh hlê muut ka hngơy lôôch dik. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Vii neq laa iq trôôch ku Vaq gô, đaneq paq kê kơyq hloq Koot ji tuôq muut Koot laa e jah varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, măn gô hnoq khienq dro nưq riirh hlê muut ka hngơy lôôch dik.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Yôôch anưq, manih Jo Thaiq ramooy truh Kadraq vii Kadraq đnooy: “Gô laa tôôp pôôt xing plêêk.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Oot đnooy: “Be aalq neq laa Jê-xu, koot kanau ku Jô-sep đơu haay xet hlolh vaq ji miq ku kơy nưq ih? Anưq aleq juneq kơy nưq đnooy đaneq: ‘Gô pôôt xing plêêk’?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê ji dăt oot: “Dayh paq ramooy dii mamuuyq đnoyq. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Be kơyq hnoq ik truh kung gô atoh Vaq, Kơy patăk dăt gô, leh taway adro nưq truh, măn gô hnoq khienq adro nưq riirh hlê muut ka hngơy lôôch dik. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Nưq laa varơuq jah valơk đom kaluh rahlăp hlit: ‘Yôôch dêq hloay hnoq jah Kơy Plêêk pato dayq.’ Paq kê dro leq heq tameng ji heq hok aduq Vaq yôôych truh kung gô. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Vii leh muuyq dro leq hmưq hloq Vaq, đêh vlôh Kơy măn đom varơuq e mot ku Kơy Plêêk — Kadraq heq hloq Vaq. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii oh ay, dro leq tuôq yôôch jah varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Gô laa tôôp ku varơuq riirh. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Mo Kơy ku oh ay heq xa ma-na đom wăngq we, yôôch oot kaxêêt. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Neq laa tôôp xing plêêk pôôt, xôq ka xing aduq tôôp nưq, kơyq xa yôôch leh kaxêêt. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Gô laa tôôp riirh xing plêêk pôôt. Atoh dro leq xa tôôp neq, dro nưq hnoq riirh dong truh đơơy đơơy. Mot kadrơy, hlek gô kung jơq laa tôôp đơu gô hnoq kahniq ăm vii varơuq riirh ku dêh araak.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Anưq laa manih Jo Thaiq takaay tayaat dii mamuuyq, đaneq: “Dơơp aleq dro neq hnoq ik ăm haay xa hlek ku kơy nưq?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Lunưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii oh ay, atoh oh ay leh xa hlek Koot Manih ji hôôch vahaap ku Kadraq, yôôych oh ay hnoq leh e varơuq riirh đom oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Adro leq xa hlek gô ji hôôch vahaap gô yôôych e varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, măn gô hnoq khienq adro nưq riirh hlê muut ka hngơy lôôch dik. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Vii hlek gô laa tuôông xa dik, ji vahaap gô laa tuôông hôôch dik. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Kơyq xa hlek gô ji hôôch vahaap gô yôôych kưq măn đom gô, ji gô kung măn đom dro nưq. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Đaji Vaq hloay riirh heq patăk dăt gô, măn gô riirh gamưh Vaq luleq, yôôych adro xa hlek gô kung hnoq riirh gamưh gô lunưq. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Neq laa tôôp xing plêêk pôôt, leh aalq đaji tôôp khơl mo kơy heq xa yôôch kaxêêt. Adro leq xa tôôp neq hnoq riirh dong truh đơơy đơơy.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Kadraq đnooy kaluh apok nưq đom hnhư tagumq tuôôy pato dayq aduq Ka-bê-na-um.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Yôôch anưq, tuôôy 'ngưng dro đom sôôq khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq tameng đanưq, oot đnooy: “Apok neq thier laa pơơl, kơyq đơu hnoq ik tameng ik ni?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Bơh vii Lôôk Jê-xu kadih xet đaneq khơl xatyauq kadraq đong ramooy truh varơuq nưq, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Apok nưq katơơk galơh oh ay ih? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Anưq atoh oh ay hloq Koot Manih tok aduq Kadraq măn adroyq neq yôôych aleq? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Kơy Phool Hiel laa Kơy dơơp ăm riirh; xăk xamơk be e ich kajoq dêq. Kaluh apok đơu thơy heq đnooy dii oh ay laa kơy phool hiel ji oot laa varơuq riirh. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Anưq bơh đom sôôq oh ay e toleq dro be tuôq.” Vii Lôôk Jê-xu heq xet adroyq yôôch kơyq laa adro leh tuôq, ji kơyq laa adro hnoq tachơơl hlê Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Ji Kadraq đnooy: “Bơy kơq nưq, thơy heq đnooy dii oh ay đaneq leh muuyq dro leq hnoq ik truh dii thơy atoh vanong leh jah Vaq kahniq ka dro nưq.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Xing tuôôy nưq, 'ngưng dro đom sôôq khơl xatyauq Kadraq wih katoor wiit xuq ji paq măn hooy kung dii Kadraq đnoyq. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Kơq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kưl vaarq dro jah rơơlh: “Dang aleq oh ay kung xung vlôh hooy?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Si-môn Phi-e-rơ tơơl hlê Kadraq: “Lôôk lơơy, 'wot hnoq hooy tyauq kơyq? Kadraq e kaluh apok ku varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />'wot tuôq ji 'yo xet đaneq Kadraq laa Kơy Vah ku Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê oot: “Be aalq Thơy heq rơơlh oh ay, laa kưl vaarq dro jah rơơlh, đơu muuyq dro đom oh ay laa kamuuych.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Kadraq đnooy truh Ju-đa koot kanau ku Si-môn Ich-ka-ri-ôt, vii jơq ni, muuyq đom kưl vaarq dro, hnoq xalih xuum Kadraq.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu hooy kađneng kahơ đom dêh Ga-li-lê, jo Kadraq leh e iq đinq hooy truh Ju-đê vii manih Jo Thaiq đong axek varơuq păk kaxêêt Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Tuôôy nưq, Lêh Raap Đơ, muuyq đơơt lêh ku manih Jo Thaiq, heq truh jeq. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Anưq, khơl ma oh kanau Kadraq đnooy dii Kadraq: “Dayh hooy klơlh aduq neq ji hooy truh Ju-đê, xôq khơl xatyauq ku ay kung hnoq hloq kaluh varơuq dơơp ku ay đơu ay dơơp ik. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Vii be kơyq dơơp muuyq varơuq kajoq nưq đom padu kadook đơu kadih axek xăk măn aduq manih karôp. Atoh ay dơơp ik kaluh varơuq luneq, dayh kahnoq vlôh xăk ka dêq hloay daak dêh.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Vii hloay ka khơl ma oh Kadraq kung leh e xuum tuôq aduq Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Vii anưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Wat ku ay koq lưp truh, bơh wat ku êêp oh yôôych tuôôy leq kung e 'miêh. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Dêh araak leh ik 'yarơ êêp oh, bơh dêh araak 'yarơ ay vii ay dơơp xanưk truh dêh araak đaneq kaluh varơuq dơơp ku ni laa xơk aak. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Êêp oh dayh hooy tok jưq lêh; ay koq lưp hooy jưq lêh neq vii wat ku ay koq lưp jah xaleep.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy đnooy đanưq dii oot, Kadraq kưq măn aduq Ga-li-lê.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Lunư, tuôôy khơl oh Kadraq hooy tok jưq lêh, yôôych tuôôy nưq Kadraq kung hooy, bơh laa tyauq trôôk du du, leh ăm xet. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Vii anưq, manih Jo Thaiq axek Kadraq đom tuôôy lêh, ji đnooy: “Kơy nưq măn 'leq?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />E 'ngưng dro katul manih karôp ramooy truh Kadraq. 'Ngưng dro đnooy đaneq: “Kơy nưq laa adro tolh.” Bơh sôôq kadrơy đnooy: “Lưp 'leq, wiit hlê, kơy nưq jarooy manih karôp hooy hyaak hyul.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Long anưq, leh e kơyq đnooy trôôk rayơh rayơơy ăm xet truh Kadraq vii yôq ka manih Jo Thaiq.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Tuôôy nưq, muut kawat katul tuôôy lêh yôôch, Lôôk Jê-xu hooy tok hnhư hơu ji pato dayq. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Anưq laa manih Jo Thaiq thier tưng hưng tuôôy đnooy: “Dơơp aleq manih neq hlolh xet kaluh apok thiêêng liêng nưq, long lưp xa hok trương lơơp?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Anưq yôôch, Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl apok oot, ji Kadraq đnooy: “Apok pato ku gô leh aalq laa ku gô, bơh laa ku Kơy Patăk dăt gô. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Atoh dro leq dêq xuum dơơp tyauq iq trôôch Kadraq, dro nưq hnoq xet truh apok pato neq e jơq laa truh xing Kơy Plêêk long laa xing kadih gô đnooy vlôh. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Adro leq xing kadih ni đơu đnooy, dro nưq xôq vih axek tađnah tađnaak ka kadih ni, bơh dro axek tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy patăk dăt ni nưq laa dro dong dik, ji be e varơuq leh hyioh jăk leq măn đom dro nưq. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Be aalq Môi-se heq kahniq ganuun ka êêp kơy ih? Đơu leh kơyq đom êêp kơy tameng jư ganuun. Aleq êêp kơy laay axek varơuq xôq păk kaxêêt gô?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Manih karôp tơơl hlê: “Kơy biq kamuuych nhôp yôôch! Kơyq xung păk kaxêêt kơy?” <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê, ji Kadraq đnooy ka oot: “Gô heq dơơp muuyq varơuq, ji dêq hloay êêp kơy raay tưng hưng. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Vii varơuq neq, Môi-se heq kahniq pheep goch kađuh ka êêp kơy (leh aalq pheep nưq e xing Môi-se, bơh laa xing khơl mo kơy), ji êêp kơy dưk dơơp goch kađuh ka khơl kanau đom hngơy Sa-bat. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Atoh muuyq dro nhonq pheep goch kađuh muut hngơy Sa-bat xôq leh huq lôp kadrôôp ganuun Môi-se, yôôych aleq êêp kơy laay tôq jaraq dii gô vii gô khienq muuyq dro jah yơh kalh paraat muut hngơy Sa-bat? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Te xưh xadrah tyauq pi gôk, đơu dayh xưh xadrah bơơn 'yo tyauq hyioh jăk.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Atêq nưq, toleq dro đom tamooy Jê-ru-sa-lem đnooy đaneq: “Be aalq neq laa manih đơu khơl drơy đong axek varơuq xôq păk kaxêêt long aleq? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Hơq, kơy nưq đnooy kach rayơh rayơơy ăm xet đơu khơl drơy be đnooy kajoq dii kơy nưq. Dang aleq khơl dưk xakaq dong dik 'yo nhonq đaneq dro neq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Lunư, haay heq xet dro neq pa iir vlôh xing leq. Măn tuôôy Lôôk Wơơt Dêh truh, be kơyq xet aduq Kadraq pa iir vlôh.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Atêq nưq, đom hnhư hơu, Lôôk Jê-xu pato dayq kôt apok ji đnooy: “Êêp kơy vơ xet gô, vơ xet gô pa iir vlôh xing leq. Gô leh kadih gô truh, bơh Kơy patăk dăt gô laa dong dik, laa Kơy đơu êêp kơy be xet. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Gô xet Kadraq vii gô vlôh xing Kadraq, ji Kadraq heq patăk dăt Gô.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Lunưq, oot axek trôôk rôp Kadraq, đơu leh e kơyq tơơk ti tol Kadraq vii wat Kadraq koq truh. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Lunư, 'ngưng dro đom manih karôp xôq xuum tuôq aduq Kadraq ji oot đnooy: “Tuôôy Lôôk Wơơt Dêh truh, leh kheoq Kadraq hnoq dơơp 'ngưng dơuq akêh iaq kaluh kajoq adro neq heq dơơp?” <verse eid="JHN 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Manih Pha-ri-si tek manih karôp đnooy ramooy toleq apok nưq truh Lôôk Jê-xu, yôôych khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt kung manih Pha-ri-si patăk khơl kuun jư hooy xôq oot rôp Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Lunưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Gô măn athêêp dii êêp kơy đom axit kawat lêq đnoyq, yôôch gô hooy truh Kơy patăk dăt gô. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Êêp kơy hnoq axek gô bơh êêp kơy hnoq leh tavơh gô, ji aduq gô măn êêp kơy hnoq leh truh ik.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Kơq nưq, manih Jo Thaiq vôôch talah mamuuyq: “Dro neq xung hooy maleq đơu haay hnoq leh axek ik kơy nưq? Dang aleq kơy nưq xung truh dii tamooy măn pachaay đom manih dêh Hi Lap yôôch pato ka tamooy Hi Lap? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Apok neq e iq kajoq đơu kơy nưq heq đnooy: ‘Êêp kơy hnoq axek gô bơh êêp kơy hnoq leh tavơh, ji aduq gô măn êêp kơy be ik truh ik’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Bơh yôôch, muut ka hngơy lôôch, laa hngơy 'yo kôt đom tuôôy lêh, Lôôk Jê-xu dưk tok yôôch kôt apok đnooy đaneq: “Atoh kơyq thaal dayh truh dii gô ji hôôch. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Dro leq tuôq aduq gô, yôôych dang đaji Rahlăp Vah đnooy: ‘Tavook daak hloay riirh hnoq hoot vlôh xing xuum dro nưq’.” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Tuôôy nưq, Kadraq đnooy varơuq neq truh Kơy Phool Hiel, Kơy đơu khơl leq tuôq aduq Kadraq jeq nhonq jah, jo Kơy Phool Hiel koq lưp rama truh vii Lôôk Jê-xu koq lưp jah vanê ayuôôt. <verse eid="JHN 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Atêq nưq, tuôôy tameng kaluh apok nưq, toleq dro đom manih karôp đnooy: “Dro neq dik jơq laa hnhư hlit.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Sôôq kadrơy đnooy: “Manih neq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.” Bơh muuyq sôôq đnooy: “Dong dik luneq, dang aleq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh pa iir vlôh xing Ga-li-lê? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Be aalq Rahlăp Vah đnooy đaneq Kơy Wơơt Dêh hnoq vlôh xing adrơơk Đa-vik ji pa iir vlôh aduq Bêt-lê-hem, laa palơy đơu Đa-vik heq riirh ih?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Vii anưq, varơuq aklah vlôh xalih vlôh đom manih karôp vii kơq Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Tuôôy nưq, toleq dro đom bing oot xung rôp Kadraq, bơh be kơyq tơơk ti rôp Kadraq ik.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Atêq nưq, khơl kuun jư 'yo wiit xuq tavơh khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji manih Pha-ri-si, khơl adro nưq vôôch oot: “Vii aleq êêp ay leh rôp kơy nưq xuq?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Khơl kuun jư 'yo tơơl: “Koq hmưq e kơyq pato dayq đaji manih neq.” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Anưq laa, khơl manih Pha-ri-si tơơl hlê oot: “Dang aleq khơl ay kung biq pa ôôh aluut yôôch ih? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />E adro leq đom khơl padrok dưk xakaq long đom bing manih Pha-ri-si tuôq aduq kơy nưq? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Lunư, bing tamooy be xet ganuun neq, bing oot dik xưngq karoay axaap!” <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Ni-kô-đem (adro hmưq truh tavơh Kadraq adroyq neq, laa muuyq dro măn đom bing nưq) đnooy dii oot: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Ganuun ku haay leh ăm đnooy xadrah muuyq dro leq, đêh vlôh adroyq dik tameng 'yo xing dro nưq ji xet dro nưq dơơp kaluh kajoq, jơq be?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Oot tơơl hlê, ji đnooy dii kơy: “Dang aleq kơy kung laa manih tamooy Ga-li-lê? Dayh lăk 'yo ji 'yo hlê, đaneq be e hnhư hlit leq jah pa iir vlôh xing Ga-li-lê.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />[Yôôch dro leq dro nưq hooy xuq hnhư oot.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu hooy tok đoot Ô-liu. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Bơh muut tuôôy xaroq meel, Kadraq laay hooy truh hnhư hơu, ji tôôy dro garuk truh dii Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl thơy pato ganuun ji khơl manih Pha-ri-si jarooy truh muuyq khơl drê biq rôp jah đom varơuq dơơp tuut taak, yôôch oot xôq ay măn katul. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Vii thưh Kadraq, khơl thơy tơơk tưp đnooy dii Kadraq xôq oot e apok rôp xadrah tachơơl hlê Kadraq: “Thơy lơơy, dro khơl drê neq biq rôp jah đôôyq dii varơuq dơơp lôp kadrôôp tuut taak. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mot kadrơy, đom ganuun, Môi-se heq pato pheq tiip ji phơu khơl adro đanưq, măn juneq, thơy đnooy aleq?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Bơh atêq tuôôy kuu pôôt, Lôôk Jê-xu valơk tol vari bơơn lôk ti kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Đom tuôôy nưq, oot kưq ratuut đnooy vlôh vôôch 'yo, Kadraq 'ngơơk tok ji dăt oot: “Kơyq đom êêp kơy leh e lôp kadrôôp, dayh xok phơu tiip muut ay neq adroyq dik.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Yôôch kuu pôôt, Kadraq laay valơk tol vari dii lôk ti kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Bơh yôôch, tưng dro muuyq đom khơl manih Jo Thaiq nưq chuh hooy, xarôp dii khơl adro kôt tuuyh dik, pheq đnooy dêq hloay oot raay luuy vlôh, ji vơ muuyq dro Kadraq măn hlê, kung dii dro khơl drê đong măn katul. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Anưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy 'ngơơk tok, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii dro khơl drê nưq: “Bing oot măn 'leq? Leh kơyq rôp kadrôôp ay ih?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Ji ay tơơl: “Leh kơyq dêq, kuh Lôôk.” Yôôch Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Gô kung leh rôp kadrôôp ay. Ay dayh hooy, xing neng paq lôp kadrôôp đnoyq.”]<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Atêq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu laay đnooy dii oot đaneq: “Gô laa xaraar tađnah ku dêh araak, dro leq tyauq gô kajưk dik hnoq leh tawaak hooy đom kamơng jaluk, bơh e xaraar tađnah ku varơuq riirh.” <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Atêq nưq, toleq dro Pha-ri-si đnooy dii Kadraq: “Thơy dơơp xanưk truh kadih thơy yôôych apok xanưk ku thơy laa leh đangq tuôq.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê ji Kadraq đnooy kung oot: “Long ju gô dơơp xanưk truh kadih gô, yôôych apok xanưk ku gô laa đangq tuôq. Vii gô xet gô xing leq truh ji gô xung hooy ka'leq, măn êêp kơy be xet gô truh xing leq long gô xung hooy ka'leq. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Êêp kơy đnooy xadrah tyauq xăk xamơk; Gô leh đnooy xadrah kơyq dêq. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Bơh hloay ka atoh đaji gô đnooy xadrah, yôôych varơuq đnooy xadrah ku gô laa hyioh jăk vii gô leh măn muuyq dro, đơu gô kung dii Vaq, laa Kơy patăk dăt gô. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Mot kadrơy, đom ganuun ku êêp kơy e valơk đaneq apok xanưk ku vaarq dro yôôych đangq tuôq. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Gô laa manih dơơp xanưk truh kadih gô, ji Vaq, laa Kơy patăk dăt gô, dơơp xanưk truh gô.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Lunưq, oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “Vaq ku thơy măn 'leq?” Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl apok: “Êêp kơy leh xet gô, kung leh xet Vaq gô; atoh êêp kơy heq xet gô, yôôych heq laa êêp kơy kung xet Vaq gô.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Kadraq đnooy kaluh apok neq aduq xôq jêêt tơơk tưp, đong tuôôy pato dayq đom hnhư hơu, bơh leh kơyq rôp jư Kadraq vii wat ku Kadraq koq lưp truh.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq laay đnooy dii oot: “Gô vlôh hooy, ji êêp kơy hnoq axek gô, yôôch êêp kơy hnoq kaxêêt đom kadrôôp maroh êêp. Aduq gô hooy, êêp kơy leh ik truh ik.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Anưq laa manih Jo Thaiq đnooy: “Dang aleq dro neq hnoq hnek ranong, vii kơy nưq đnooy: ‘Aduq gô hooy êêp kơy leh ik truh ik’?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Ji Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Êêp kơy pa iir vlôh xing pi 'laarq, gô pa iir vlôh xing ataalh. Êêp kơy laa manih ku dêh araak neq, gô leh aalq manih dêh araak neq. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Kơq nưq, gô đnooy dii êêp kơy đaneq êêp kơy hnoq kaxêêt đom kadrôôp maroh êêp. Vii atoh êêp kơy leh tuôq đaneq gô dik đanưq, yôôych êêp kơy hnoq kaxêêt đom kadrôôp maroh êêp.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Vii anưq, oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “Thơy laa kơyq?” Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy ka oot: “Varơuq kajoq đơu gô pheq đnooy heq đnooy dii êêp kơy xing tuôôy xarôp? <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Gô e 'ngưng varơuq xôq đnooy ji xôq xưh xadrah truh êêp kơy. Long anưq, Kơy patăk dăt gô laa dong dik; vơ hloay kaluh kajoq gô tameng aduq Kadraq yôôych gô đnooy kaluh varơuq nưq ka dêh araak.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Oot leh hlolh đaneq Kadraq đong đnooy truh Vaq ka oot. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yôôch anưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Tuôôy êêp kơy kađnok Koot Manih tok, yôôych tuôôy nưq êêp kơy hnoq xet đaneq gô dik đanưq, ji Gô be kadih gô dơơp varơuq kajoq. Wih hlê, gô đnooy kaluh varơuq neq tyauq đaji Vaq heq pato gô. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Kơy patăk dăt gô măn kung dii gô; Kadraq leh ka'lăk gô muuyq dro, vii gô hloay dơơp varơuq kaxay xuum Kadraq.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Đom tuôôy Kadraq đong pato kaluh apok nưq, 'ngưng dro xôq xuum tuôq aduq Kadraq.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yôôch Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii khơl manih Jo Thaiq heq tuôq Kadraq: “Atoh êêp kơy kưq măn đom apok ku gô, yôôych êêp kơy dik laa khơl xatyauq ku gô; <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />êêp kơy hnoq xet varơuq dik, ji varơuq dik hnoq luh vlôh êêp kơy.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Oot tơơl hlê kung Kadraq: “'Wot laa koot xau Ap-ra-ham ji koq hmưq dơơp xapok ka kơyq dêq; aleq thơy đnooy đaneq: ‘Êêp kơy hnoq jah rayơh rayơơy’?” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê oot: “Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii êêp kơy, đaneq dro leq lôp kadrôôp yôôych laa dơơp xapok ka kadrôôp. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mot kadrơy, dơơp xapok leh kưq măn miet đom hnhư, Koot yôôych kưq măn hloay hloay. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Vii anưq, atoh Koot luh vlôh êêp kơy, yôôych êêp kơy hnoq dong dik jah rayơh rayơơy. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Gô xet đaneq êêp kơy laa koot xau Ap-ra-ham, bơh êêp kơy axek trôôk păk kaxêêt gô vii apok gô be e aduq đom êêp kơy. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Gô đnooy kaluh varơuq gô heq hloq aduq Vaq; măn êêp kơy yôôych dơơp kaluh varơuq êêp kơy tameng aduq vaq êêp.” <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Oot tơơl hlê ji đnooy dii Kadraq: “Vaq ku 'wot laa Ap-ra-ham.” Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Atoh kajoq êêp kơy laa koot xau ku Ap-ra-ham, yôôych êêp kơy heq dơơp kaluh varơuq dơơp ku Ap-ra-ham. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Bơh juneq, êêp kơy axek kach păk kaxêêt gô, muuyq dro đơu heq đnooy ka êêp kơy varơuq dik, laa varơuq gô tameng xing Kơy Plêêk. Ap-ra-ham heq be dơơp varơuq đanưq. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Êêp kơy dơơp kaluh varơuq ku vaq êêp.” Lunưq, oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “'Wot jah pa iir vlôh be aalq xing varơuq apuq atrăp; 'wot e muuyq Vaq, laa Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy ka oot: “Atoh kajoq Kơy Plêêk laa Vaq ku êêp kơy, yôôch heq đol laa êêp kơy heq xung xiaq gô, vii gô truh xing Kơy Plêêk, ji e mot kađnen; bơyh gô leh kadih truh, bơh jơq Kadraq heq patăk dăt gô. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Vii aleq đơu êêp kơy leh hlolh đơơt đnooy athêêk neq ku gô? Nưq laa vii êêp kơy leh e paraat tameng kaluh apok ku gô. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Êêp kơy thuôk xuq vaq êêp, nưq laa kamuuych, ji êêp kơy e xuum dơơp tyauq kaluh hmưch trôôch ku vaq êêp. Xing kapa tep ni laa adro păk kaxêêt manih ji be hmưq dưk kajưk đom varơuq dik, vii be e varơuq dik đom ni. Tuôôy ni đnooy apok pa ôôh lar, yôôych ni đnooy xing xuum klaak ku ni vii ni laa adro đnooy pa ôôh ji laa vaq ku varơuq đnooy pa ôôh. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Bơh vii gô đnooy dik, lunưq êêp kơy leh tuôq gô. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Kơyq đom êêp kơy tauq vlôh ik gô e kadrôôp? Atoh gô đnooy dong dik, vii aleq êêp kơy leh tuôq gô? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Dro leq thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk yôôych tameng apok ku Kơy Plêêk; vii kơq nưq êêp kơy leh tameng bơyh vii êêp kơy leh thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="JHN 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Manih Jo Thaiq tơơl hlê ji đnooy dii Kadraq: “'Wot be đnooy troq ih, đaneq kơy laa manih Sa-ma-ri ji biq kamuuych nhôp?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê: “Gô leh biq kamuuych nhôp; wiit hlê, gô kul vado Vaq gô, măn êêp kơy yôôych đnooy ra ơơh ka gô. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Mot kadrơy, gô leh axek akhiim tađnah tađnaak ku gô; e muuyq Kơy axek akhiim ji xưh xadrah. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii êêp kơy, atoh dro leq tameng jư apok gô, yôôych dro nưq kajưk dik hnoq leh hloq varơuq kaxêêt truh đơơy đơơy.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Manih Jo Thaiq đnooy dii Kadraq: “Juneq 'wot 'yo nhonq đaneq kơy biq kamuuych nhôp. Ap-ra-ham ji khơl hnhư hlit heq kaxêêt, đơu kơy yôôych đnooy: ‘Atoh dro leq tameng jư apok gô, adro nưq kajưk dik hnoq leh jah xet varơuq kaxêêt truh đơơy đơơy.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Dang aleq kơy yôôych kôt lơyq iaq mo kơy Ap-ra-ham ku 'wot, laa muuyq dro heq kaxêêt ih? Khơl hnhư hlit kung heq kaxêêt. Kơy kadih 'yo kơy laa?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê: “Atoh gô kadih ayuôôt laat gô, yôôych tađnah tađnaak ku gô be laa kajoq; Vaq gô laa Kơy ayuôôt laat gô, đơu êêp kơy taayh Kơy nưq đaneq Kadraq laa Kơy Plêêk ku êêp. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Êêp kơy 'miêh be xet Kadraq, bơh gô xet Kadraq. Ji atoh gô đnooy đaneq: ‘Gô leh xet Kadraq,’ yôôych gô laa dro đnooy pa ôôh dang đaji êêp kơy. Lunư, gô xet Kadraq ji tameng jư apok Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Ap-ra-ham, mo kơy êêp kơy hlah hlaak xôq hnoq ik 'yo hloq hngơy ku gô, kơy heq hloq ji hlah hlaak.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Nưq laa manih Jo Thaiq đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kơy koq lưp jah dăp kưl tuuyh, đơu kơy heq hloq Ap-ra-ham ih?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii êêp kơy, adroyq tuôôy e mot Ap-ra-ham, gô Hloay E.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Kơq nưq, oot tôôch phơu xôq tiip muut Kadraq, bơh Lôôk Jê-xu kadook mot ji hooy vlôh klơlh hnhư hơu.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yôôch đong tuôôy hooy trôôk, Kadraq hloq muuyq dro apul xing tuôôy đơơu pa iir. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Khơl xatyauq Kadraq vôôch Kadraq đaneq: “Ra-bi, kơyq heq lôp kadrôôp, ay nưq long miq vaq ay nưq, xôq yôôch ay đơơu pa iir vlôh heq apul?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê: “Leh aalq ay nưq lôp kadrôôp, kung leh aalq miq vaq ay nưq, bơh nưq laa xôq varơuq dơơp ku Kơy Plêêk jah kahnoq vlôh aduq ay nưq. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Neq laa varơuq kơn duh ka haay xôq dơơp varơuq dơơp ku Kơy patăk dăt thơy đom tuôôy măn ka hngơy. Klôôy jeq truh laa tuôôy be kơyq hnoq ik dơơp varơuq ik. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Đom tuôôy thơy măn đom dêh araak, thơy laa xaraar tađnah ku dêh araak.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Atêq tuôôy đnooy toleq apok nưq, Kadraq kaxôh pôôt vari, ji dii daak dieu, Kadraq anhơơu jêêk wưk, yôôch para ka ay nưq wưk nưq tol mot ku ay. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Kadraq đnooy dii ay: “Dayh hooy, 'nhaau aduq hlôôk daak Si-lô-ê” (ni iq laa “Jah Patăk Hooy”). Vii anưq, ay hooy ji 'nhaau mot, yôôch tađnah mot hlê. <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Atêq nưq, khơl adro đom palơy ji khơl manih 'yo hloq ay nưq droyq neq, xing tuôôy ay laa muuyq dro vôôch xa, oot đnooy: “Be aalq neq laa adro ragơy 'ngôôy vôôch xa ih?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Muuyq sôôq đnooy đaneq: “Nưq laa ay nưq.” Sôôq kadrơy yôôych đnooy: “Leh aalq 'leq, lunư, dro nưq yôôych dang ay nưq.” Ay yôôych kưq đnooy đaneq: “Jơq laa gô.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Lunưq, oot đnooy dii ay: “Dơơp đaleq mot ay tađnah ik?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Ay nưq tơơl hlê: “Manih jah taayh laa Jê-xu heq anhơơu wưk ji para mot gô, yôôch dăt gô đaneq: ‘Dayh hooy truh Si-lô-ê ji 'nhaau.’ Lunưq, atêq tuôôy hooy ji 'nhaau, gô 'yo hloq ik.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Oot đnooy dii ay: “Adro nưq măn 'leq?” Ay nưq tơơl: “Gô leh xet.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Oot jarooy ay nưq, adro adroyq neq biq apul, truh aduq khơl manih Pha-ri-si. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />(Tuôôy nưq laa hngơy Sa-bat, Lôôk Jê-xu heq anhơơu wưk ji luh mot ku ay nưq muut ka hngơy nưq.) <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Atêq nưq, khơl manih Pha-ri-si laay kung vôôch ay dơơp aleq đơu ay ik tađnah mot. Yôôch ay nưq đnooy dii oot: “Kơy nưq para wưk tol mot gô, ji gô hooy 'nhaau yôôych hloq ik.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Atêq nưq, toleq dro đom sôôq khơl manih Pha-ri-si đnooy: “Adro neq leh thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk, vii ni leh tameng jư hngơy Sa-bat.” Sôôq kadrơy yôôych đnooy: “Dơơp aleq muuyq dro, laa adro e kadrôôp, hnoq ik dưk dơơp kaluh dơuq akêh đanưq?” Ji yôôch e varơuq aklah vlôh đom khơl oot. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Lunưq oot vôôch ay apul yưk tra: “Ay đnooy kajoq truh kơy nưq, xing tuôôy kơy nưq heq luh mot ay?” Yôôch anưq, ay đnooy đaneq: “Kơy nưq laa muuyq kơy hlit.” <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Vii anưq, Manih Jo Thaiq leh tuôq varơuq truh ay đaneq ay nưq heq hmưq apul đơu 'yo hloq ik, miet truh tuôôy oot dăt taayh miq vaq ku ay nưq, laa adro heq yơh hlê klong mot. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Oot vôôch miq vaq ay đaneq: “E jơq neq laa koot ku mo kơy, adro đơu mo kơy đnooy laa đơu jah pa iir heq apul? Anưq yôôch, dơơp luleq juneq ay nưq hloq ik?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Anưq laa miq vaq ku ay tơơl hlê ji oot đnooy: “'Wot 'yo xet đaneq neq laa koot kanau 'wot, ji đaneq ni jah pa iir vlôh heq apul. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Bơh juneq, dơơp đaleq ni 'yo hloq ik, 'wot leh xet, long kơyq heq luh mot ku ni, 'wot leh xet. Dayh vôôch ni; ni heq kôt yôôch. Ni hnoq kadih đnooy ka ni.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Miq vaq ay đnooy toleq apok đanưq vii oot yôq manih Jo Thaiq. Bơyh manih Jo Thaiq heq athêêk adroyq yôôch, đaneq atoh adro leq xưng nhonq Kadraq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, yôôych adro nưq biq pađuôôy klơlh hnhư hơu. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Vii kơq nưq, miq vaq ay heq đnooy đaneq: “Ni heq kôt yôôch, dayh vôôch ni.” <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Lunưq, truh yưk thưq vaarq, oot dăt taayh adro đơu heq hmưq biq apul ji đnooy dii ay: “Dayh tưp tađnah tađnaak ka Kơy Plêêk. Haay xet đaneq dro nưq laa muuyq dro e kadrôôp.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Anưq yôôch ay nưq tơơl: “Kơy nưq laa adro e kadrôôp long leh, gô leh xet. Gô xet muuyq varơuq, nưq laa long biq apul, bơh juneq gô 'yo hloq ik.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Atêq nưq, oot đnooy dii ay: “Adro nưq heq dơơp kajoq ka ay? Kơy nưq heq luh mot ay đaji luleq?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Ay tơơl hlê oot: “Gô heq taboon ka êêp kơy yôôch, đơu êêp kơy leh tameng! Aleq êêp kơy trôôch tameng hlê đnoyq? Be aalq êêp kơy kung trôôch jah dơơp khơl xatyauq ku kơy nưq ih?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ji yôôch oot toah đnooy ay ji đnooy: “Ay đơơu laa khơl xatyauq ku adro nưq, măn 'wot laa khơl xatyauq ku Môi-se. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />'Wot xet đaneq Kơy Plêêk xanoh dii Môi-se, bơh dro neq, 'wot leh xet laa xing leq truh.” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Adro khơl kanau tơơl hlê ji đnooy dii oot: “Juneq yôôych varơuq neq đơu laa 'yo akêh, đaneq kơy nưq heq luh mot gô đơu êêp kơy leh xet kơy nưq laa xing leq truh. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Haay xet đaneq Kơy Plêêk leh tameng apok khơl adro kadrôôp maroh, bơh atoh adro leq e xuum kuh kul ji dơơp tyauq iq trôôch Kadraq, yôôych Kadraq tameng apok dro nưq. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Xing tuôôy hnu, koq hmưq jah tameng varơuq muuyq dro leq luh mot ku adro apul xing tuôôy đơơu pa iir. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Atoh dro neq leh aalq laa xing Kơy Plêêk, yôôych dro nưq be ik dơơp ik paq kê varơuq kajoq?” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Oot tơơl hlê ji đnooy ka ay: “Ay xaleep jah pa iir vlôh đom kadrôôp maroh đơu ay đong pato dayq 'wot ih?” Yôôch oot pađuôôy ay nưq vlôh.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Lôôk Jê-xu tameng đaneq oot heq pađuôôy ay vlôh pi gôk yôôch axek tavơh ay, Kadraq đnooy: “Ay e tuôq aduq Koot Manih be?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Ay nưq tơơl apok ji đnooy: “Dro nưq laa kơyq, kuh Kadraq, xôq gô hnoq ik tuôq muut kadraq?” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii ay: “Ay kung heq hloq kadraq, ji nưq laa manih đong đnooy dii ay neq.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Tuôôy nưq, ay đnooy: “Kuh Lôôk, gô tuôq,” ji ay akuh Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Gô heq truh đom dêh araak neq vii varơuq xưh xadrah, xôq ka khơl adro leh hloq hnoq ik hloq ik, ji khơl adro 'yo hloq hnoq vlôh apul.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Xing đom bing manih Pha-ri-si đong măn đnư dii Kadraq, oot tameng kaluh apok nưq, yôôych vôôch Kadraq: “Dang aleq 'wot kung biq apul?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy kung oot: “Atoh êêp kơy biq apul yôôych anưq laa êêp kơy leh e kadrôôp, bơh juneq êêp kơy đnooy đaneq: ‘'Wot hloq ik.’ Lunưq, kadrôôp ku êêp kơy măn ja kađnư.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy dii êêp kơy, kơyq leh dalơh hlê 'mok tuôôy hooy muut chuông trưưu, đơu laay tok muut bơơn trôôk kadrơy, nưq laa adro atôk ji adro varoh. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Bơh adro xing 'mok hooy muut laa manih xakaq ku trưưu. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Manih jư 'mok luh 'mok ka dro nưq, ji trưưu tameng apok ku adro xakaq, yôôch manih xakaq taayh anơng yal trưưu ku ni đơu jarooy oot vlôh pi gôk. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Tuôôy manih xakaq heq jarooy dêq trưưu ni vlôh, ni hooy adroyq oot, măn trưưu tyauq atêq ni, vii oot qween xet apok ku manih xakaq. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Bơh oot kajưk dik hnoq leh hooy tyauq dro be xet, wiit hlê, oot xadăk klôônq klơlh ni, vii oot leh qween xet apok ku khơl adro be xet.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy apok atoh neq ka oot, bơh toleq dro nưq leh hlolh kaluh varơuq Kadraq đnooy dii oot laa kajoq.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Lunưq, Lôôk Jê-xu laay đnooy dii oot: “Dong dik, dong dik, gô đnooy ka êêp kơy đaneq gô laa 'mok ku trưưu. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Dêq hloay dro leq truh adroyq gô laa adro atôk ji adro varoh, bơh trưưu leh tameng tyauq bơy oot. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Gô laa poop 'mok. Atoh dro leq hooy muut dalơh hlê gô, yôôch dro nưq hnoq jah wơơt, yôôch dro nưq hnoq hooy muut, hooy vlôh ji axek hloq manay rek. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Adro atôk leh truh atoh be aalq laa xôq varoh atôk, păk kaxêêt ji păk kaxêêt dêq. Gô truh xôq trưưu e varơuq riirh ji e jah trôôk galơh galaay. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Gô laa manih xakaq tamaq kaxay. Manih xakaq tamaq kaxay chiuq kaxêêt xăk riirh gô vii trưưu. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Adro dơơp hngơy, vii leh aalq laa adro xakaq, đơu trưưu leh aalq laa ku ni, lunưq ni hloq xo vari truh yôôych ka'lăk tăk trưưu ji xadăk jư xăk, măn xo vari varoh rôp trưưu ji dơơp ăm pachaay hyaak, <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />vii ni laa adro dơơp hngơy anưq đôôyq dii ni, ưng duh tabông be aalq laa truh trưưu. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Gô laa manih xakaq tamaq kaxay, gô 'yo xet trưưu ku gô, ji trưưu ku gô 'yo xet gô, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />dang đaji Vaq xet gô, gô kung xet Vaq; ji gô chiuq kaxêêt xăk riirh gô vii trưưu. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Gô e kaluh trưưu kadrơy đơu leh măn đom chuông neq. Oot kung anưq, duh gô jarooy xuq, ji oot hnoq tameng apok gô, yôôch hnoq vơ e muuyq bơy, kung muuyq dro xakaq. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Vii varơuq neq, Vaq xiaq gô, vii gô chiuq kaxêêt xăk riirh gô xôq muuyq yưk tra, gô hnoq ik nhonq jah ni. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Leh kơyq xok xăk riirh gô klơlh gô, lunư, gô kadih chiuq kaxêêt ni, Gô e qwuyen chiuq kaxêêt xăk riirh gô, ji gô e qwuyen nhonq xok ni yưk tra. Gô heq nhonq xok tanưưl neq xing Vaq gô.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Varơuq aklah vlôh laay xalih vlôh đom khơl manih Jo Thaiq vii kaluh apok nưq. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Tuôôy nưq, 'ngưng manih đom bing oot đnooy: “Dro neq biq kamuuych nhôp ji ta'ngơk. Aleq êêp kơy tameng ni?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Sôôq kadrơy yôôych đnooy: “Neq leh aalq laa toleq apok ku adro biq kamuuych nhôp. Dang aleq kamuuych hnoq ik luh mot adro apul?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Atêq nưq, Lêh Hnhư Hơu Đơơu jah dơơp aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem. Tuôôy nưq laa xiêk ka oaq, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />ji Lôôk Jê-xu đong hooy hlê đom hnhư hơu aduq ra vook Sa-lô-môn. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Atêq nưq, khơl manih Jo Thaiq dưk rawiit Kadraq, ji oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “Thơy kưq dơơp biit ravơq đom xuum ku 'wot dong truh dong leq? Atoh Thơy laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, dayh đnooy tyauq trôôk rayơh rayơơy ăm xet ka 'wot.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl apok oot: “Gô heq đnooy dii êêp kơy ji êêp kơy leh tuôq. Kaluh varơuq đơu gô dưk dơơp đom yal Vaq gô, oot dơơp xanưk ka gô. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Lunư, êêp kơy leh tuôq vii êêp kơy leh thuôk xuq trưưu ku gô. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Trưưu gô tameng apok gô, măn gô 'yo xet oot, ji oot tyauq gô. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Gô kung kahniq ka oot varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, ji oot kajưk dik leh biq hư hlơơp truh miet miet, ji hnoq be kơyq varoh ik paq kê trưưu leq đom sôôq oot klơlh ti gô. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Vaq Gô, Kơy heq kahniq oot ka gô, laa kôt lơyq iaq dêq hloay, ji be kơyq hnoq ik varoh oot klơlh ti Vaq. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Gô ji Vaq laa muuyq.” <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Khơl manih Jo Thaiq laay xok phơu xôq hnoq ik tiip Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê dii oot: “Gô heq kahnoq ka êêp kơy 'ngưng varơuq kaxay xing Vaq. Êêp kơy xok phơu tiip gô vii varơuq leq đom sôôq kaluh varơuq nưq?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Khơl manih Jo Thaiq tơơl hlê Kadraq: “'wot leh tiip phơu kơy vii varơuq kaxay, bơh vii kadrôôp katơơk galơh, ji vii kơy, laa muuyq dro manih araak, đong kadih xưng kơy laa Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê oot: “Đom ganuun ku êêp kơy, be aalq e apok jah valơk đaneq: ‘Gô xanoh: “Êêp koot laa yaak”’ jơq be? <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Atoh Kadraq taayh oot, nưq laa khơl adro đơu apok ku Kơy Plêêk truh dii, laa yaak (ji Rahlăp Vah be ik biq phaq ka'lăk), <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />yôôych aleq êêp kơy đnooy dii Kơy đơu Kơy Plêêk heq xôq đêh ji patăk dăt muut đom dêh araak đaneq: ‘Kơy katơơk galơh,’ vii gô đnooy: ‘Gô laa Koot Kơy Plêêk’? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Atoh gô leh đong dơơp kaluh varơuq ku Vaq gô, yôôych te tuôq gô. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Bơh atoh gô đong dơơp, long tabơh êêp kơy leh tuôq gô, yôôych dayh tuôq kaluh varơuq nưq, xôq êêp kơy hnoq ik xet ji hlolh đaneq Vaq đom gô, ji gô đom Vaq.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Vii anưq, oot laay axek trôôk rôp Kadraq đơu Kadraq xaloot klơlh ti oot.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Muuyq yưk tra, Kadraq wiit xuq piik pi hơq tavook daak Jô-đanh, truh aduq đơu adroyq neq Jăng dơơp bap-tem yôôch Kadraq măn aduq nưq. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />'Ngưng manih truh dii Kadraq ji oot đnooy đaneq: “Long Jăng heq leh dơơp dơuq akêh leq, bơh tôôy varơuq đơu Jăng heq đnooy truh manih neq laa jơq.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ji aduq nưq, 'ngưng dro xôq xuum tuôq aduq Kadraq.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Tuôôy nưq, e muuyq dro hơq biq bingq, anơng La-xa-rơ dêh Bê-tha-ni, măn palơy ku Ma-ri ji ay ku mư laa Ma-thê. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Măn Ma-ri laa adro para jơu thơơm ka Lôôk yôôch 'nhuôôt jôôk Kadraq bơơn hlôôk ku mư, đơu ma oh kanau ku mư laa La-xa-rơ 'miêh đong jiq bingq. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Lunưq, baarq oh ay gamưh adro atăq hêêl truh Kadraq đaneq: “Kuh Lôôk, 'yo hơq, manih đơu Kadraq xung xiaq đong biq bingq.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Bơh atêq tuôôy tameng anưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Bingq neq leh pheq truh kaxêêt, lunư, vii tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk, xôq Koot Kơy Plêêk jah ayuôôt laat gamưh varơuq nưq.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />(Lôôk Jê-xu xung xiaq Ma-thê, ma oh kadrê ku mư, ji La-xa-rơ.) <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Kơq nưq, tuôôy Kadraq tameng đaneq La-xa-rơ đong jiq bingq, long anưq tuôôy nưq, Kadraq măn hlê vaarq hngơy ka aduq đơu Kadraq đong măn. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Atêq nưq, atêq varơuq tahyơq hlê nưq, Kadraq đnooy dii khơl xatyauq: “Haay kơn hooy truh dêh Ju-đê yưk tra.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Khơl xatyauq tơơl dii Kadraq: “Ra-bi, juneq manih Jo Thaiq đong axek trôôk tiip phơu thơy, đơu thơy măn hooy xuq đnư yưk tra ih?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl: “Be aalq e kưl vaarq wat muut ka hngơy ih? Atoh dro leq hooy đom ka hngơy yôôych dro nưq leh xatôôlh gưlh, vii ni 'yo hloq xaraar tađnah ku dêh araak neq. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Măn atoh dro leq hooy đom ka klôôy, yôôych dro nưq xatôôlh gưlh, vii xaraar tađnah leh măn aduq ni.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Kadraq heq đnooy đanưq, yôôch atêq nưq, Kadraq đnooy ka oot: “La-xa-rơ, 'wơyq ku haay, heq vik tawol hlơơp, bơh thơy truh laa xôq hnoq ik nhơk kah ay nưq.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Lunưq, khơl xatyauq đnooy dii Kadraq: “Lôôk lơơy, atoh ay nưq heq vik tawol hlơơp, yôôch ay nưq hnoq ik yơh hlê.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />(Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu 'miêh đnooy truh varơuq kaxêêt ku La-xa-rơ, bơh khơl dro nưq biit đaneq Kadraq đong đnooy truh varơuq padơy vado ku varơuq vik.) <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Lunưq, tuôôy nưq Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy hlolh vlôh ka oot: “La-xa-rơ heq kaxêêt. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Thơy hlah hlaak vii kơq e ich ku oh ay vii thơy heq leh e mot măn đnư, xôq oh ay hnoq ik tuôq. Long anưq, haay duh truh dii ay nưq.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Anưq yôôch, Thô-ma, jah taayh laa Đi-đim, đnooy dii khơl xatyauq kung tyauq Kadraq: “Haay kung duh hooy xôq haay hnoq ik kaxêêt muuyq aduq dii Kadraq.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Vii anưq, tuôôy truh aduq, Lôôk Jê-xu 'yo hloq ay nưq heq măn đom xanưng poot hngơy yôôch. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Tuôôy nưq, Bê-tha-ni măn jeq Jê-ru-sa-lem, kaplah xing nưq kơh kưl dăp êch-ta-đơ. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />'Ngưng dro đom sôôq khơl manih Jo Thaiq heq truh dii Ma-thê ji Ma-ri xôq oot hnoq ik hlơq hlôôp baarq mư truh adro ma oh kanau. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Anưq yôôch, tuôôy Ma-thê tameng đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu truh, mư hooy đoonq Kadraq, măn Ma-ri 'ngôôy đom hnhư. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Tuôôy nưq, Ma-thê đnooy dii Lôôk Jê-xu: “Lôôk lơơy, atoh Kadraq 'miêh măn đnen, yôôych heq laa ma oh kanau gô heq leh kaxêêt. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Lunư, pheq đnooy tuôôy nưq, gô xet đaneq paq kê varơuq kajoq đơu Kadraq vôôch Kơy Plêêk, Kơy Plêêk hnoq kahniq ka Kadraq.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii mư: “Ma oh kanau ku mư hnoq riirh hlê.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Ma-thê tơơl dii Kadraq: “Gô xet đaneq oh nưq hnoq riirh hlê đom varơuq riirh hlê muut ka hngơy lôôch dik.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii mư: “Thơy laa varơuq riirh hlê ji varơuq riirh; adro leq tuôq aduq thơy hnoq riirh, long tabơh heq kaxêêt yôôch; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />măn kơyq riirh đơu tuôq aduq thơy yôôych kajưk dik leh hnoq kaxêêt truh đơơy đơơy. Ay e tuôq varơuq neq be?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Mư tơơl hlê Kadraq: “Jơq, Lôôk lơơy, gô tuôq đaneq Kadraq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, Koot Kơy Plêêk, laa Kơy pheq truh đom dêh araak.” <verse eid="JHN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Đnooy đanưq yôôch, mư wiit xuq ji taayh đêh Ma-ri, oh mư, đnooy: “Thơy măn đnen ji đong taayh oh.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Tuôôy mư nưq tameng anưq, yôôych mư vơ dưk tok hloay ji truh dii Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu koq muut đom palơy bơh măn ja măn ka aduq đơu Ma-thê heq tavơh Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Tuôôy nưq, toleq dro manih Jo Thaiq, laa khơl adro đong măn dii mư đom hnhư ji hlơq hlôôp mư, tuôôy hloq đaneq Ma-ri pơl wol dưk tok ji hooy vlôh pi gôk, yôôych hooy tyauq mư, biit laa mư hooy truh xanưng xôq mư nhim aduq nưq. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Anưq yôôch, hloay tuôôy Ma-ri truh aduq Lôôk Jê-xu dưk padơy, tuôôy 'yo hloq Kadraq, mư kul pôôt aduq jôôk Kadraq, đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, atoh Kadraq 'miêh măn đnen, yôôych heq laa ma oh kanau gô heq leh kaxêêt.” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Anưq, tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu hloq mư nhim, ji khơl manih Jo Thaiq hooy muuyq aduq dii mư kung nhim, Kadraq hloq jiq xuum đom phool hiel ji kadih xăk Kadraq arơơk xuum. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Kadraq vôôch: “Oh ay xôq ay nưq măn ka'leq?” Oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, apôôy truh ji 'yo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Lôôk Jê-xu nhim. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Vii anưq, toleq dro Jo Thaiq đnooy: “'Yo hơq, kơy nưq xung xiaq ay nưq xet toleq!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Bơh toleq dro đom sôôq oot đnooy: “Kơy neq, laa manih heq luh mot ku adro apul, kung leh ik dơơp kajoq ik xôq ka adro neq klơlh kaxêêt ih?” <verse eid="JHN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Vii anưq, đom tuôôy laay jiq xuum đom xăk, Lôôk Jê-xu hooy truh xanưng. Tuôôy nưq, nưq laa muuyq kôôp phơu, ji muuyq talaat phơu jah klook đơ kangưưr kôôp. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Lôôk Jê-xu patăk: “Dayh vlơq phơu hooy.” Ma-thê, ay ku adro heq kaxêêt, đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, oh nưq heq tek hlôôl yôôch, vii hngơy neng laa hngơy thưq poot.” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii mư: “Be aalq Thơy heq đnooy dii ay đaneq atoh ay tuôq, yôôych ay hnoq hloq tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk ih?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Lunưq, oot vlơq kuk phơu vlôh. Yôôch Lôôk Jê-xu 'ngơơk mot tol plêêk ji đnooy: “Kuh Vaq, koot kuh kway Vaq vii Vaq heq tameng koot. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Đơu koot 'miêh heq xet đaneq Vaq hloay hloay tameng, bơh koot đnooy vlôh vii kơq manih karôp đong dưk gah gih neq, xôq oot hnoq ik tuôq đaneq Vaq patăk koot truh.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ji atêq tuôôy đnooy đanưq, Kadraq taayh atok kôt apok: “La-xa-rơ, dayh hooy vlôh pi gôk!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Adro heq kaxêêt hooy vlôh, jôôk ji ti măn ja biq gwonq vaayh ko, măn mot ay đong biq gwonq khanh. Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Dayh tơq vlôh waak ay nưq ji xôq ay nưq hooy.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Kơq nưq, 'ngưng dro đom bing manih Jo Thaiq, laa khơl adro heq truh hlơq Ma-ri ji atêq tuôôy jah hloq varơuq Kadraq dơơp, oot heq xôq xuum tuôq aduq Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Bơh toleq dro đom bing oot hooy truh dii bing manih Pha-ri-si ji taboon hlê ka toleq dro neq kaluh varơuq đơu Lôôk Jê-xu heq dơơp.<verse eid="JHN 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Lunưq, khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt kung manih Pha-ri-si anguk hlê Tayuup Karôp Jo Thaiq ji athêêk tajauq: “Haay pheq dơơp kajoq neq, vii dro neq dơơp 'ngưng dơuq akêh dik? <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Atoh haay kưq xôq anưq kơy nưq đanưq, yôôych tôôy dro hnoq tuôq muut kơy nưq, yôôch manih La-mah hnoq truh ji hmơt xok dêq aduq neq hloay daak dêh ku haay.” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Lunư, Kai-phe, muuyq dro đom sôôq oot, laa thơy tơơk tưp kôt đom xanưm nưq, đnooy dii oot: “Êêp kơy leh xet kajoq dêq. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Êêp kơy leh biit truh đaneq nưq laa varơuq tolh iaq ka êêp kơy tuôôy xôq muuyq dro kaxêêt thay ka manih karôp đơu dêq hloay tamooy leh biq kaxêêt hlơơp ih?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Tuôôy nưq, kơy nưq heq đnooy varơuq nưq leh truh xing kadih kơy, bơh vii laa thơy tơơk tưp kôt xanưm nưq, lunưq kơy heq đnooy hlit đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu jeq pheq kaxêêt vii tamooy, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />ji leh vơ laa vii tamooy neq, đơu măn laa xôq koot xau ku Kơy Plêêk biq măn pachaay hnoq ik wiit xuq jêêk muuyq. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Lunưq, xing hngơy nưq, oot xôq vih xôq oot hnoq ik jarooy Kadraq muut aduq kaxêêt.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Kơq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu leh măn hooy hlê ăm xet đom khơl manih Jo Thaiq đnoyq, bơh Kadraq hooy klơlh aduq nưq hooy truh dêh jeq wăngq we, đom muuyq theng jah taayh laa Ep-ra-im. Kadraq măn aduq nưq dii khơl xatyauq. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Tuôôy nưq, Lêh Dalơh Hlê ku manih Jo Thaiq jeq truh, 'ngưng dro xing dêh palơy hooy tok truh Jê-ru-sa-lem adroyq ka hngơy Lêh Dalơh Hlê xôq oot hnoq ik paxa rêh kadih oot. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Anưq laa, oot axek akhiim Lôôk Jê-xu, ji đnooy dii mamuuyq tuôôy dưk đom hnhư hơu: “Dii khơl kơy, varơuq nưq 'yo dang đaji luleq? Đaneq kơy nưq kajưk dik hnoq leh truh jưq lêh?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji manih Pha-ri-si heq patăk dăt, xôq ka atoh dro leq xet Kadraq măn 'leq, dro nưq pheq tauq hlê xôq oot hnoq ik rôp Kadraq.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Atêq nưq, drơu hngơy adroyq ka Lêh Dalơh Hlê, Lôôk Jê-xu hoot truh Bê-tha-ni, aduq La-xa-rơ măn, neq laa adro đơu Lôôk Jê-xu heq khienq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Anưq laa oot adoot ka Kadraq waal klôôy ka đnư, ji Ma-thê yôôych hơu varơuq, măn La-xa-rơ laa muuyq đom khơl adro 'ngôôy muuyq aduq para xa dii Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Atêq nưq, atêq tuôôy xok muuyq kơn jơu thơơm kam tung dik thier quiq jaq, Ma-ri para jôôk Lôôk Jê-xu, ji 'nhuôôt jôôk Kadraq bơơn hlôôk ku mư. Tuôôy nưq, đom hnhư jah thơơm rahuut dii muuy thơơm ku jơu nưq. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Bơh Ju-đa Ich-ka-ri-ôt, muuyq đom khơl xatyauq Kadraq, adro hnoq xalih xuum hlê Kadraq, đnooy đaneq: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Vii aleq kave jơu thơơm neq leh jah adrơk tek tađôôy xok pe hreek đơ-ni-ê, yôôch ăm ahlook ka manih adrah?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />(Tuôôy nưq, ay nưq đnooy anưq be aalq vii ka varơuq tabông truh đôôyq dii ay laa truh manih adrah, bơh vii ay laa dro atôk xok, ji tuôôy jư thuuyq jêêt, ay xok atôk jêêt jah tưp muut đnư.) <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Vii anưq Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Dayh xôq ay jah ieen, xôq ay hnoq ik jư ni ka hngơy up xôq ku thơy. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Vii oh ay hloay e manih adrah gah êêp, bơh oh ay leh hloay hloay e thơy.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Yôôch anưq, muuyq bing karôp kôt xing khơl manih Jo Thaiq heq xet ik đaneq Kadraq đong măn đnư, anưq oot garuk truh, be aalq vơ vii Lôôk Jê-xu, đơu kung xôq oot hnoq ik 'yo hloq La-xa-rơ, laa adro đơu Kadraq heq khienq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Bơh khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt heq xôq vih, aleq ka oot kung hnoq ik păk kaxêêt hloay La-xa-rơ; <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />bơyh vii ay, 'ngưng manih Jo Thaiq heq ka'lăk đơu tuôq aduq Lôôk Jê-xu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Hngơy atêq, bing tamooy thier karôp, laa khơl adro truh jưq lêh, tuôôy tameng đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu đong hooy truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />heq xok kaluh đook triaq, yôôch oot hooy vlôh xôq đoonq Kadraq ji đnooy kôt: “Hô-sa-na! Ayuôôt laat Kơy truh đom yal Lôôk, laa Vuua I-sơ-ra-ên!” <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq axek jah muuyq ôô lưưa chwoay, Lôôk Jê-xu 'ngôôy acho tol ni, đaji apok jah valơk: <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Nee, koot kadrê Si-ôn, te yôq. 'Yo hơq, Vuua ku koot đong truh, acho tol ôô lưưa koot.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Tuôôy patep, khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq leh hlolh kaluh varơuq nưq; bơh tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu heq jah tađnah tađnaak, yôôych oot văch hlê đaneq kaluh apok nưq heq jah valơk truh Kadraq, khơl drơy kung heq dơơp đanưq ka Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Atêq nưq, manih karôp raay dơơp xanưk truh Kadraq, oot laa khơl adro e mot kung dii Kadraq tuôôy Kadraq taayh La-xa-rơ vlôh klơlh xanưng ji khienq ay riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Vii kơq nưq, manih karôp kung hooy vlôh đoonq Kadraq, vii oot tameng đaneq Kadraq heq dưk dơơp muuyq dơuq akêh đanưq. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Lunưq, manih Pha-ri-si đnooy dii mamuuyq: “Êêp kơy hloq laa êêp kơy be dơơp vlôh raa kajoq dêq jơq be? 'Yo hơq, dêq dêh araak heq hooy tyauq kơy nưq.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Tuôôy nưq, e toleq dro manih Hi Lap hơq đom sôôq khơl adro hooy tok xôq oot hnoq ik ayuôôt laat muuyq katuôôy lêh. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Yôôch anưq, khơl adro neq truh tavơh Phi-lip, manih jah pa iir vlôh xing Bêt-sai-đa, dêh Ga-li-lê, ji oot gamưh kơy, đaneq: “Kơy lơơy, 'wot xung tavơh Thơy Jê-xu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Phi-lip hooy ji đnooy dii Anh-rê; Anh-rê kung Phi-lip hooy yôôch tơơl dii Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê oot, đaneq: “Wat heq truh xôq ka Koot Manih jah ayuôôt laat. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Dong dik, dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, atoh kalook va qwaay, atêq tuôôy jah pêêt pôôt vari, leh kaxêêt hlơơp, yôôych ni măn ja đanưq muuyq dro; bơh atoh ni kaxêêt, yôôych ni hnoq vlôh play 'ngưng. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Adro leq xiaq xăk riirh ni yôôych hnoq hlơơp ni; bơh kơyq 'yarơ xăk riirh ni đom đơơy neq hnoq jư ik ni ka varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Atoh dro leq hơu varơuq thơy, yôôych dro nưq pheq tyauq thơy; ji thơy măn 'leq, dro hơu varơuq thơy kung hnoq măn đnư, Atoh dro leq hơu varơuq thơy, yôôych Vaq hnoq vanê vado dro nưq. <verse eid="JHN 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Juneq, phool hiel thơy đong xôôl dôôl, ji thơy duh đnooy kajoq? ‘Vaq lơơy, apôôy wơơt Koot klơlh wat neq?’ Lunư, jơq vii varơuq nưq đơu thơy heq truh đom wat neq. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Vaq lơơy, apôôy vanê ayuôôt yal Vaq.” Yôôch anưq, muuyq apok xanoh truh xing plêêk: “Gô heq jah vanê ayuôôt ji Gô hnoq vanê ayuôôt đnoyq.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Atêq nưq, vii 'miêh heq dưk đnư ji tameng hloq, manih karôp đnooy đaneq hnưm kơy kata đơu ahna vlôh. Muuyq sôôq kadrơy đnooy: “Muuyq kơy yaak heq đnooy dii kơy nưq.” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê ji Kadraq đnooy: “Apok xanoh neq leh ahna vlôh vii gô, bơh laa vii êêp kơy. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Juneq laa varơuq xưh xadrah ku dêh araak neq: Juneq, adro dưk xanok dêh araak neq hnoq biq avih vlôh pi gôk. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Măn gô, ji tuôôy gô biq tơơk tok klơlh vari, gô hnoq hruy tôôy dro truh kung gô.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Tuôôy nưq, Kadraq đong đnooy varơuq neq xôq đnooy truh trôôk kaxêêt leq đơu Kadraq hnoq chiuq. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Yôôch anưq manih karôp vôôch hlê Kadraq: “'Wot e tameng xing ganuun đaneq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh hnoq măn truh đơơy đơơy. Aleq kơy đnooy đaneq: ‘Varơuq băt dăt đôôyq dii Koot Manih laa biq kađnok tok’? Kơyq laa Koot Manih nưq?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Lunưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Xaraar tađnah đong măn dii êêp kơy muuyq kawah lêq heq. Dayh tawaak hooy đom tuôôy êêp kơy e xaraar tađnah, xôq kamơng jaluk leh rôp jư êêp kơy. Adro tawaak hooy đom kamơng jaluk leh xet ni hooy maleq. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Đom tuôôy êêp kơy e xaraar tađnah, dayh tuôq muut xaraar tađnah xôq êêp kơy jah dơơp koot ku xaraar tađnah.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy kaluh apok nưq yôôch hooy chuh, Kadraq kadook xăk klơlh oot. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Long tabơh Lôôk Jê-xu heq dơơp thier 'ngưng pheq akêh kangưưr mot oot, bơh oot kung leh tuôq muut Kadraq, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />xôq apok ku hnhư hlit Ê-sai jah jêêk, đơu kơy heq đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Kuh Lôôk, kơyq tuôq apok taboon hlê ku 'wot koot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">ji kok ti ku Lôôk heq kahnoq vlôh ka kơyq?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Vii kơq nưq, oot leh ik tuôq, vii Ê-sai laay đnooy đnoyq:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Kadraq heq khienq mot oot apul, ji Kadraq heq dơơp ka xuum oot găk khăk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">xôq kheoq đaneq oot hnoq ik hloq bơơn mot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ji hlolh xet đom xuum, yôôch wiit hlê,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ji gô hnoq payơh ka oot.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Ê-sai heq đnooy kaluh apok nưq vii kơy 'yo hloq tađnah tađnaak ku Kadraq ji đnooy truh Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Long anưq, ji đaneq hloay ka 'ngưng adro đom khơl padrok dưk xanok tuôq muut Kadraq, bơh vii kơq khơl manih Pha-ri-si, lunưq oot leh hôôk xưng vlôh xôq ka oot be huq biq đuôôy klơlh hnhư tagumq. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Vii oot ưng trôôch apok vanê tok xing khơl drơy iaq laa varơuq vanê tok xing Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu kôt apok đnooy đaneq: “Kơyq tuôq aduq gô yôôych leh vơ laa tuôq muut gô, bơh măn laa tuôq truh Kơy patăk dăt gô, <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />ji kơyq hloq gô laa hloq Kơy patăk dăt gô. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Gô heq truh dơơp xaraar tađnah đom dêh araak, xôq kơyq tuôq muut gô, be kưq măn đom kamơng jaluk. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Ji atoh dro leq tameng apok gô đơu leh tameng jư, yôôych gô leh xưh xadrah dro nưq; vii gô heq truh leh aalq xôq gô xưh xadrah dêh araak, bơh xôq gô wơơt dêh araak. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Adro leq chôôyq ka'lăk gô ji leh chiuq tuôq xok apok gô yôôych e Kơy xưh xadrah dro nưq. Jơq apok đơu gô heq đnooy neq hnoq xưh xadrah dro nưq muut ka hngơy lôôch dik. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Vii gô leh vii kadih gô đơu đnooy, bơh Kơy patăk dăt gô, nưq laa kadih Vaq heq kahniq tanưưl ka gô, apok leq gô duh xanoh ji varơuq kajoq gô duh đnooy. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Ji gô xet đaneq tanưưl ku Kadraq laa varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy. Lunưq, kaluh varơuq gô đnooy, đaji Vaq heq pato ka gô luleq, yôôych gô đnooy hlê đaji lunưq.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Tuôôy nưq, adroyq Lêh Dalơh Hlê, Lôôk Jê-xu xet đaneq wat ku Kadraq heq truh, xôq ka Kadraq hooy klơlh dêh araak neq xuq dii Vaq. Tuôôy heq xiaq khơl adro thuôk ku kadraq đom dêh araak, yôôych Kadraq xiaq oot dong truh lôôch đơơy. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Đong waal xa klôôy, atêq tuôôy kamuuych heq xôq muut xuum Ju-đa Ich-ka-ri-ôt, koot kanau ku Si-môn, xôq ni xalih xuum hlê Kadraq, <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />vii xet đaneq Vaq heq pahnăp muut ti Kadraq tôôy varơuq, ji xet đaneq Kadraq truh xing Kơy Plêêk ji jeq wiit xuq dii Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />lunưq Kadraq dưk tok klơlh waal xa, leh aau gôk. Ji atêq tuôôy xok khanh, Kadraq gwonq rawiit xăk kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq uk daak muut xalaau ji xarôp 'nhaau jôôk khơl xatyauq, ji 'nhuôôt kateh bơơn khanh đơu ni heq jah gwonq rawiit xăk. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Yôôch anưq, Kadraq truh aduq Si-môn Phi-e-rơ. Kơy đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, Kadraq 'nhaau jôôk ku gô ih?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê ji đnooy dii kơy: “Varơuq thơy đong dơơp, juneq ay koq hlolh, bơh atêq kaluh varơuq neq, ay hnoq hlolh.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Phi-e-rơ tơơl dii Kadraq: “Kajưk dik leh e 'leq thơy 'nhaau jôôk ku gô.” Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê kơy: “Atoh thơy leh 'nhaau ka ay, yôôych ay be e phon kajoq dii thơy.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Si-môn Phi-e-rơ đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, leh vơ jôôk gô heq, đơu măn ka ti ji akoq gô đnoyq.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Dro leq heq jah hôôp yôôch yôôych leh e duh đanưq, đêh vlôh 'nhaau jôôk, măn dro nưq jah xarơyh xaleep, ji oh ay yôôych jah xarơyh bơh leh aalq dêq hloay oh ay.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />(Vii Kadraq xet kơyq xalih xuum hlê Kadraq, kơq anưq Kadraq đnooy đaneq: “Leh aalq dêq hloay raay jah xarơyh.”)<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Anưq, tuôôy Kadraq heq 'nhaau jôôk oot yôôch ji hlưp aau gôk ku kadraq muut, yôôych Kadraq 'ngôôy pôôt hlê, đnooy dii oot: “Oh ay e xet thơy đơơu dơơp kajoq ka oh ay be? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Oh ay taayh Thơy laa ‘Thơy’, ji laa ‘Lôôk’: oh ay đnooy jơq dik vii thơy dik laa đanưq. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Lunưq, atoh thơy, laa Lôôk, ji laa Thơy, heq 'nhaau jôôk ku oh ay, yôôch oh ay kung pheq 'nhaau jôôk ku mamuuyq. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Vii Thơy heq dơơp ramil ka oh ay xôq oh ay kung dơơp dang đaji thơy heq dơơp ka oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Dong dik, dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, xapok yôôych leh kôt iaq kôôch ni; adro jah patăk kung leh kôt iaq adro patăk dăt ni. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Atoh oh ay heq xet kaluh varơuq neq, yôôych oh ay jah vanong atoh oh ay dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq nưq. <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Thơy leh đong đnooy truh dêq hloay oh ay; thơy xet adro đơu thơy heq rơơlh — bơh xôq apok Rahlăp Vah jah jêêk: ‘Adro xa tôôp kung dii gô tơơk jôôk ni tachơơl hlê gô.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Xing juneq, thơy đnooy ka oh ay adroyq tuôôy varơuq xalih vlôh, xôq tuôôy ni xalih vlôh, oh ay hnoq ik tuôq đaneq thơy Hloay E. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Dong dik, dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, kơyq tiip dro leq đơu thơy patăk dăt laa tiip thơy, ji kơyq tiip thơy laa tiip Kơy heq patăk dăt thơy.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Atêq tuôôy đnooy yôôch kaluh varơuq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu hlu rơu đom xuum klaak, yôôch Kadraq 'yo nhonq ji đnooy: “Dong dik, dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, muuyq dro đom khơl oh ay hnoq xalih xuum hlê thơy.” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Khơl xatyauq 'yo mamuuyq, leh xet Kadraq đong đnooy truh kơyq. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Tuôôy nưq, muuyq đom khơl xatyauq Kadraq, adro đơu Lôôk Jê-xu xiaq, đong 'ngôôy pi para xa, ganưq muut tada ku Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Kơq nưq, Si-môn Phi-e-rơ dơơp dơuq ka adro neq vôôch 'yo, “Adro đơu thơy đong đnooy truh laa dro leq?” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Vii anưq lunưq, atêq tuôôy 'ngiik xăk ka tada Lôôk Jê-xu, dro nưq đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, nưq laa kơyq?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl: “Nưq laa dro đơu atêq katuôôy 'nharuuk kapleh tôôp neq, thơy hnoq xôq ni ji palo ka adro nưq.” Yôôch anưq, 'nharuuk kapleh tôôp nưq yôôch, Kadraq palo ka Ju-đa, koot ku Si-môn Ich-ka-ri-ôt. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Atêq kapleh tôôp nưq, yôôych tuôôy nưq Sa-tan nhôp muut ni. Lunưq, Lôôk Jê-xu dăt ni: “Varơuq ay đong dơơp, dayh dơơp dayh yơu.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />(Tuôôy nưq, leh kơyq đong 'ngôôy aduq para xet ik vii aleq Kadraq đnooy dii ni đanưq. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Vii toleq dro măn biit, vii Ju-đa jư thuuyq jêêt, lunưq Lôôk Jê-xu dăt ni: “Dayh root kaluh thưq kơn duh ka tuôôy lêh,” long xôq ahlook axit kajoq nưq ka adro adrah.) <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Anưq laa, tuôôy heq nhonq kapleh tôôp, ni vơ hloay hooy vlôh. Tuôôy nưq, dêh heq kamơng.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Anưq, tuôôy ni heq hooy klơlh, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Juneq, Koot Manih heq jah vanê ayuôôt, ji Kơy Plêêk heq jah vanê ayuôôt aduq Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Yôôch Kơy Plêêk hnoq vanê ayuôôt Koot Manih đom kadih Kadraq, ji Kadraq hnoq vanê ayuôôt Koot Manih hloay jơnưq. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Êêp koot de lơơy, thơy măn dii oh ay leh xiit đnoyq 'leq. Oh ay hnoq axek thơy, ji đaji thơy heq đnooy dii khơl manih Jo Thaiq đaneq, ‘Aduq gô hooy, êêp kơy leh ik truh ik.’ Juneq, thơy kung đnooy đanưq dii oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Thơy kahniq ka oh ay muuyq ganeen đơơu, xôq ka oh ay hnoq ik xung xiaq mamuuyq; đaji thơy heq xung xiaq oh ay, xôq oh ay kung hnoq ik xung xiaq mamuuyq. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Atoh oh ay e xung xiaq deng ka mamuuyq, yôôych vii nưq, tôôy dro hnoq xet đaneq oh ay laa khơl xatyauq ku thơy.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Si-môn Phi-e-rơ đnooy dii Kadraq: “Lôôk lơơy, Kadraq hooy maleq?” Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê kơy: “Aduq Thơy hooy, juneq oh ay koq ik tyauq Thơy ik, bơh atêq neq, oh ay hnoq hooy tyauq.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Phi-e-rơ đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, vii aleq gô leh ik tyauq Kadraq hloay juneq ik? Gô hnoq chiuq kaxêêt xăk riirh gô vii Kadraq.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl: “Ay hnoq chiuq kaxêêt xăk riirh ay vii thơy ih? Dong dik, dong dik, thơy đnooy dii ay, kajưk dik ier pôô leh rok dong truh tuôôy ay chôôyq thơy pe yưk.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Xuum oh ay te biq xôôl dôôl. Oh ay tuôq aduq Kơy Plêêk yôôych oh ay kung tuôq aduq thơy. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Đom hnhư Vaq Thơy e 'ngưng aduq măn. Đơu atoh leh e, yôôych thơy hnoq heq đnooy dii oh ay yôôch, vii thơy đong hooy xôq ralauq 'meq ka oh ay muuyq aduq. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Atoh Thơy hooy ji ralauq 'meq ka oh ay muuyq aduq, yôôch thơy hnoq truh yưk tra ji đoonq oh ay tyauq dii thơy, xôq thơy măn 'leq yôôch oh ay kung măn đnư. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Oh ay heq xet trôôk truh aduq đơu thơy đong hooy.” <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Thô-ma vôôch Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, 'wot leh xet Kadraq đong hooy maleq. Dơơp aleq 'wot hnoq ik xet trôôk ik?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Thơy laa trôôk hooy, varơuq dik, ji varơuq riirh; be kơyq truh ik dii Vaq atoh leh gamưh thơy. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Atoh oh ay heq xet thơy, yôôych oh ay kung hnoq xet Vaq thơy. Xing neng, oh ay heq xet Kadraq ji heq hloq Kadraq.” <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Phi-lip đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, xiin pato Vaq ka 'wot, đanưq laa ik ka 'wot yôôch.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Thơy heq măn dii oh ay muuyq kawat xiik đanưq đơu ay koq xet thơy ih, Phi-lip? Dro leq heq hloq thơy laa heq hloq Vaq. Aleq ay đnooy: ‘Xiin pato Vaq ka 'wot’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Ay leh tuôq đaneq thơy măn đom Vaq, ji Vaq măn đom thơy ih? Kaluh apok đơu thơy đnooy dii oh ay yôôych leh bơyh kadih thơy đnooy vlôh, bơh Vaq hloay riirh đom thơy đong dưk dơơp varơuq dơơp ku Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Dayh tuôq thơy, đaneq thơy măn đom Vaq, ji Vaq măn đom thơy; Măn atoh leh, yôôych dayh tuôq vii kơq kadih kaluh varơuq dơơp ku thơy. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Dong dik, dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, dro leq tuôq muut thơy, yôôych dro nưq kung hnoq dơơp kaluh varơuq đơu thơy dơơp, ji hnoq dơơp kaluh varơuq kôt iaq đanưq, vii thơy jeq xuq kung Vaq. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Paq kê varơuq kajoq đơu oh ay taayh yal thơy apôôy vôôch, thơy hnoq dơơp varơuq nưq 'yo, xôq Vaq jah ayuôôt laat gamưh Koot. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Atoh oh ay taayh yal thơy vôôch thơy varơuq kajoq, thơy hnoq dơơp varơuq nưq. <verse eid="JHN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Atoh oh ay xung xiaq thơy, yôôych oh ay hnoq jư kaluh ganeen ku thơy, <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />thơy kung hnoq apôôy vôôch Vaq, ji Kadraq hnoq kahniq ka oh ay Kơy Hlơq Hlôôp kadrơy xôq Kơy nưq măn dii oh ay dong truh đơơy đơơy, <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />nưq laa Yaak Varơuq Dik, laa Kơy đơu dêh araak leh ik nhonq ik, bơyh vii dêh araak leh nhonq hloq Kadraq, kung leh xet Kadraq. Oh ay yôôych xet Kadraq, vii Kadraq hloay măn dii oh ay ji hnoq măn đom oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Thơy hnoq leh ka'lăk oh ay măn đa đêh 'leq; Thơy truh kung oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Măn leh xiik đnoyq, dêh araak be măn hloq thơy; bơh oh ay yôôych hloq thơy, vii thơy riirh, oh ay kung hnoq riirh. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Đom hngơy nưq, oh ay hnoq xet đaneq thơy măn đom Vaq thơy, oh ay măn đom thơy, ji thơy kung măn đom oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Dro leq e kaluh ganeen ku thơy ji tameng jư oot, nưq laa adro xung xiaq thơy; ji adro xung xiaq thơy hnoq jah Vaq thơy xung xiaq; thơy kung hnoq xung xiaq dro nưq ji kahnoq vlôh kadih thơy ka dro nưq.” <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Ju-đa (leh aalq laa Ich-ka-ri-ôt) đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, varơuq kajoq xalih vlôh đơu Kadraq xung kahnoq vlôh truh Kadraq ka 'wot đơu leh ka dêh araak?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê ji Kadraq đnooy kung kơy: “Atoh dro leq xung xiaq thơy, yôôych dro nưq hnoq tameng jư apok thơy. Vaq thơy hnoq xung xiaq dro nưq; ji Haay hnoq truh dii dro nưq, yôôch dơơp vlôh muuyq aduq măn đom dro nưq. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Adro leh xung xiaq thơy yôôych leh tameng jư apok thơy. Apok đơu oh ay tameng leh aalq laa ku thơy, đơu laa ku Vaq, Kơy patăk dăt thơy.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Đong tuôôy đong măn dii oh ay, thơy heq đnooy dii oh ay kaluh varơuq neq. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Lunư, Kơy Hlơq Hlôôp — laa Kơy Phool Hiel đơu Vaq hnoq taayh yal thơy patăk truh — Kơy nưq hnoq pato oh ay tôôy varơuq ji ahmưk nhăk hlê ka oh ay tôôy varơuq đơu thơy heq đnooy dii oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Thơy xôq hlê ka oh ay varơuq hrok hrol; Thơy kahniq varơuq hrok hrol ku thơy ka oh ay, thơy kahniq ka oh ay leh đaji dêh araak ăm. Xuum oh ay te biq xôôl dôôl, kung te varaal yôq. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Oh ay heq hmưq tameng đaneq thơy heq đnooy dii oh ay: ‘Thơy vlôh hooy yôôch thơy hnoq truh dii oh ay.’ Atoh oh ay xung xiaq thơy, oh ay hnoq heq jah hlah hlaak tuôôy thơy đong truh kung Vaq, vii Vaq măn kôt galơh iaq thơy. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Juneq, Thơy heq đnooy adroyq varơuq xalih truh ka oh ay, xôq tuôôy varơuq xalih truh yôôych oh ay e xuum tuôq. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Thơy hnoq leh đnooy athêêp 'ngưng varơuq dii oh ay đnoyq, vii adro adrơk qwuyen dêh araak neq đong truh. Ji ni be e phon kajoq aduq thơy, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />bơh xôq manih araak xet ik đaneq thơy xung xiaq Vaq, ji Vaq xanoh pato ka thơy đaji luleq, yôôych thơy dưk dơơp đaji đanưq. Dayh dưk tok, haay duh hooy klơlh đnen.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Thơy laa ưk nho dik, ji Vaq Thơy laa manih pêêt nho. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Tuôôy đook leq đom thơy leh vlôh play, yôôych Kadraq goch ka'lăk ni; măn đook leq vlôh play, yôôych Kadraq goch 'meq đook nưq xôq ni hnoq ik vlôh play 'ngưng iaq. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Oh ay jah xarêh yôôch gamưh apok đơu thơy heq đnooy ka oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Dayh kưq măn đom thơy, ji thơy đom oh ay. Luleq đook nho leh e ik kadih ni vlôh play atoh ni leh kơq măn đom ưk nho, yôôych kung đanưq, oh ay leh ik kadih oh ay vlôh play atoh oh ay leh kưq măn đom thơy. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Thơy laa ưk nho, oh ay laa đook. Kơyq kưq măn đom thơy, ji thơy đom oot, yôôych dro nưq vlôh play 'ngưng, vii aklah vlôh klơlh thơy, oh ay be hnoq ik dơơp kajoq ik. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Atoh kơyq leh kưq măn đom thơy, yôôych dro nưq biq qweek ka'lăk pi gôk dang đaji đook biq kateh, khơl drơy tôôch anguk oot ji qweek muut đom ôôlh, yôôch oot biq jaq juch. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Atoh oh ay kưq măn đom thơy, ji apok thơy kưq măn đom oh ay, dayh vôôch varơuq kajoq êêp trôôch, yôôych varơuq nưq hnoq jah dưk dơơp ka oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Vaq thơy jah vanê ayuôôt đom varơuq neq, nưq laa oh ay vlôh play 'ngưng ji oh ay vlôh jêêk khơl xatyauq ku thơy. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Vaq heq xung xiaq thơy đaleq, thơy kung xung xiaq oh ay đanưq. Dayh kưq măn đom xung xiaq ku thơy. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Atoh oh ay jư kaluh ganeen ku thơy, yôôych oh ay hnoq kưq măn đom xung xiaq ku thơy, dang đaji thơy heq jư kaluh ganeen ku Vaq ji kưq măn đom xung xiaq ku Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Thơy heq đnooy kaluh varơuq neq ka oh ay, xôq xuum hlah ku thơy măn đom oh ay, ji xôq xuum hlah ku oh ay jah xaleep. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Neq laa ganeen ku thơy, nưq laa oh ay xung xiaq ka mamuuyq đaji thơy heq xung xiaq oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Leh kơyq e xung xiaq kôt iaq luneq — nưq laa muuyq dro chiuq kaxêêt xăk riirh ni thaay ka khơl 'wơyq ku dro nưq. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Oh ay laa 'wơyq ku thơy atoh oh ay dơơp kaluh varơuq thơy xanoh pato ka oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Thơy leh taayh oh ay laa xapok đnoyq, vii xapok leh xet varơuq kôôch ni dơơp. Bơh thơy heq taayh oh ay laa 'wơyq, vii tôôy varơuq đơu thơy heq tameng aduq Vaq thơy, yôôych thơy kahnoq ka oh ay xet. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Leh aalq oh ay heq rơơlh gô, bơh thơy heq rơơlh oh ay ji lâp oh ay, xôq oh ay hooy, raak play, ji play ku oh ay jah măn hlê, xôq paq kê varơuq kajoq đơu oh ay taayh yal thơy đơu apôôy vôôch Vaq, yôôych Kadraq kahniq ka oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Thơy xanoh pato oh ay kaluh apok neq xôq oh ay xung xiaq mamuuyq. <verse eid="JHN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Atoh dêh araak 'yarơ oh ay, yôôych dayh xet đaneq dêh araak heq 'yarơ thơy adroyq oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Atoh oh ay laa manih ku dêh araak, yôôych dêh araak hnoq heq xung xiaq adro laa thuôk ku ni. Bơh vii oh ay leh aalq manih ku dêh araak, đơu wiit hlê, thơy heq rơơlh oh ay xing katul dêh araak, kơq nưq dêh araak 'yarơ oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Dayh văch hlê apok đơu thơy heq đnooy dii oh ay: ‘Xapok yôôych leh kôt iaq kôôch ku ni.’ Atoh oot rôp toop thơy, yôôych oot kung hnoq rôp toop oh ay; atoh oot jư apok thơy, yôôych oot kung hnoq jư apok ku oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Bơh vii kơq yal ku thơy, oot hnoq dơơp tôôy varơuq nưq đôôyq dii oh ay, vii oot be hmưq 'yo xet Kơy patăk dăt thơy. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Atoh thơy leh truh ji padoh đnooy ka oot, yôôych oot be e kadrôôp, bơh juneq, oot be măn e kơq xôq đnooy kadook ka kadrôôp ku kadih oot. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Adro 'yarơ Thơy yôôych kung 'yarơ Vaq thơy. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Atoh thơy heq leh dưk dơơp katul oot kaluh varơuq đơu be e kơyq dơơp ik, yôôych oot be e kadrôôp, bơh juneq oot heq 'yo hloq yôôch măn 'yarơ hloay thơy ji Vaq thơy. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Lunư, nưq laa xôq ăm jah jêêk apok jah valơk đom ganuun ku oot đaneq: ‘Oot 'yarơ gô be ekơq.’ <verse eid="JHN 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Tuôôy Kơy Hlơq Hlôôp truh, nưq laa Kơy xing aduq Vaq đơu thơy hnoq patăk truh ka oh ay — laa Yaak Varơuq Dik vlôh xing Vaq — Kadraq hnoq dơơp xanưk truh thơy. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Đơu oh ay kung dơơp xanưk đnoyq, vii oh ay măn dii thơy xing tuôôy patep.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Thơy heq đnooy kaluh varơuq nưq ka oh ay, xôq oh ay leh huq xatôôlh gưlh. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Oot hnoq khienq ka oh ay biq pađuôôy klơlh hnhư tagumq. Lunưq đơu kawat jeq truh laa deng ka tôôy dro păk kaxêêt oh ay biit đaneq oot đong tưp kuah lêh ayuôôt laat tok Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Oot hnoq dơơp kaluh varơuq nưq vii oot leh xet Vaq, kung leh xet thơy. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Long anưq, thơy heq đnooy kaluh varơuq neq ka oh ay xôq tuôôy kawat ku bơy oot truh, oh ay văch hlê kaluh apok đơu thơy heq xanoh ka oh ay. Mot kadrơy, thơy leh đnooy kaluh varơuq neq ka oh ay xing tuôôy patep vii thơy 'miêh đong măn dii oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Măn juneq thơy hooy truh Kơy patăk dăt thơy, ji be kơyq đom oh ay vôôch thơy: ‘Thơy đong hooy maleq?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Wiit hlê, varơuq hlu rơu heq galôp viik xuum klaak ku oh ay vii thơy heq đnooy dii oh ay kaluh varơuq neq. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Lunư, thơy đnooy varơuq dik dii oh ay, thơy vlôh hooy nưq laa varơuq taway ich lơơy ka oh ay. Vii atoh thơy leh vlôh hooy, yôôych Kơy Hơq Hlôôp hnoq leh truh dii oh ay. Măn atoh thơy hooy, yôôych thơy hnoq patăk dăt Kơy nưq truh kung oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Tuôôy heq truh, Kơy nưq hnoq kahnoq vlôh dêh araak truh kadrôôp maroh, truh varơuq hyioh jăk, ji truh varơuq xưh xadrah — <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />truh kadrôôp maroh, laa vii oot leh tuôq aduq thơy; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />truh varơuq hyioh jăk, laa vii thơy truh dii Vaq, lunưq oh ay hnoq paq măn hloq thơy đnoyq; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />măn truh varơuq xưh xadrah, laa vii adro dưk xanok dêh araak neq heq biq xưh xadrah. <verse eid="JHN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Thơy e 'ngưng varơuq iaq xôq đnooy dii oh ay, bơh juneq oh ay koq lưp ik tameng hlolh ik. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Bơh tuôôy Kơy nưq, laa Yaak Varơuq Dik truh, Kadraq hnoq jarooy oh ay muut đom tôôy varơuq dik, vii Kadraq hnoq leh kadih kadraq đnooy vlôh, đơu Kadraq hnoq đnooy paq kê varơuq kajoq Kadraq tameng, ji Kadraq hnoq đnooy pahêêr ka oh ay kaluh varơuq đong xalih truh. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Kơy nưq hnoq vanê ayuôôt thơy, vii Kadraq hnoq nhonq xok kaluh varơuq xing aduq thơy yôôch hnoq kahnoq vlôh ka oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Tôôy varơuq, paq kê kaluh kajoq Vaq e, laa thuôk ku thơy. Vii anưq, thơy đnooy đaneq, Kơy nưq hnoq nhonq xok kaluh varơuq ku thơy ji kahnoq ka oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Măn leh xiik đnoyq, oh ay leh măn hloq thơy, yôôch laay atêq leh xiik, oh ay hnoq hloq thơy.” <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Atêq nưq, toleq dro đom sôôq khơl xatyauq Kadraq đnooy dii mamuuyq: “Varơuq neq laa đaleq tuôôy thơy đnooy dii haay đaneq: ‘Đom leh xiik đnoyq, oh ay leh hloq thơy, yôôch laay atêq leh xiik, oh ay hnoq hloq thơy’ ji: ‘Vii thơy truh dii Vaq’?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Kơq nưq, oot đnooy: “‘Leh xiik’ iq laa aleq? Haay be xet thơy đong đnooy kajoq.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Lôôk Jê-xu xet đaneq oot xung vôôch Kadraq, anưq Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “E jơq oh ay đong kadih oh ay axek akhiim truh apok đơu thơy heq đnooy: ‘Đom leh xiik đnoyq, oh ay leh hloq thơy, yôôch laay atêq leh xiik, oh ay hnoq hloq thơy’? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Dong dik, dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq oh ay hnoq nhim ook, alo, măn dêh araak hnoq hlah hlaak. Oh ay hnoq hlu rơu, bơh varơuq hlu rơu ku oh ay hnoq vlôh jêêk varơuq hlah hlaak. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Tuôôy khơl drê pa iir yôôych e đơơt jiq jiêh vii wat ni heq truh, bơh tuôôy heq pa iir ik oh de, mư paq măn văch truh đơơt pơơl jiq ku ni đnoyq vii kơq xuum hlah hlaak vii muuyq dro heq jah pa iir vlôh đom dêh araak. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Kung đanưq, juneq oh ay e varơuq hlu rơu, bơh thơy hnoq tavơh hlê oh ay, yôôch xuum oh ay hnoq jah hlah hlaak, ji leh kơyq taway hooy ik xuum hlah hlaak ku oh ay klơlh oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Muut hngơy nưq oh ay hnoq leh vôôch thơy varơuq kajoq. Dong dik, dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, paq kê varơuq kajoq oh ay apôôy vôôch Vaq taayh yal thơy, Kadraq hnoq kahniq ka oh ay. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Dong truh juneq, oh ay koq lưp apôôy vôôch varơuq kajoq taayh yal thơy. Dayh apôôy vôôch yơu, yôôych oh ay hnoq nhonq jah, xôq hlah hlaak ku oh ay jah xaleep.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />Thơy heq đnooy kaluh varơuq neq dii oh ay bơơn kaluh apok atoh; tuôôy kawat truh, thơy hnoq paq măn đnooy dii oh ay bơơn kaluh apok atoh đnoyq, tađôôy muut đnư, thơy hnoq kahnoq ka oh ay kach xet hlolh truh Vaq. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Đom hngơy nưq, oh ay hnoq apôôy vôôch taayh yal thơy, ji thơy leh đnooy dii oh ay đaneq thơy hnoq apôôy vôôch Vaq thay ka oh ay, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />vii jơq Vaq xung xiaq oh ay, vii oh ay xung xiaq thơy ji tuôq đaneq thơy heq truh xing Vaq. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Thơy heq truh xing Vaq ji heq muut đom dêh araak. Yôôch thơy laay hooy klơlh dêh araak ji hooy truh kung Vaq.” <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq tơơl: “'Yo hơq, juneq thơy đong đnooy ăm xet hlolh, đơu leh đnooy bơơn apok atoh. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Juneq, 'wot xet đaneq thơy hlolh xet tôôy varơuq, ji be duh pheq e kơyq vôôch thơy. Vii nưq, 'wot tuôq đaneq thơy heq truh xing Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê oot: “Juneq oh ay e tuôq be? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Dayh 'yo, wat đong truh — ji heq truh — yôôych oh ay biq pachaay hyaak, tôôy dro tyauq trôôk đêh raa ni, măn thơy yôôych oh ay ka'lăk hlê muuyq dro. Long anưq, thơy be hmưq biq muuyq dro, vii Vaq măn kung thơy. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Thơy heq đnooy kaluh varơuq neq ka oh ay xôq ka oh ay e varơuq hrok hrol aduq thơy. Oh ay tavơh pơơl dal đom dêh araak, bơh dayh kajưk xuum, thơy heq jay dêh araak yôôch.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy kaluh apok nưq yôôch 'ngơơk mot tok tol plêêk, Kadraq tơơl: “Kuh Vaq, wat heq truh. Apôôy dơơp tađnah tađnaak Koot ku Vaq, xôq Koot hnoq ik dơơp tađnah tađnaak Vaq, <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Vii Vaq heq kahniq ka koot qwuyen da uh tol tôôy paroh xăk xamơk, xôq khơl leq đơu Vaq heq pahnăp ka Koot, yôôych Koot kahniq ka khơl adro nưq varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Măn neq laa varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, Jơq laa xôq khơl dro nưq 'yo xet Vaq, Kơy Plêêk dong dik muuyq heq, ji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, laa Kơy Vaq heq patăk truh. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Koot heq dơơp tađnah tađnaak Vaq tol vari, payôôch varơuq dơơp đơu Vaq heq pahnăp ka Koot xôq Koot dưk dơơp. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Vaq lơơy, juneq apôôy Vaq dơơp tađnah tađnaak Koot kangưưr Vaq bơơn varơuq tađnah tađnaak đơu Koot 'miêh e gah Vaq adroyq tuôôy dêh araak heq e. <verse eid="JHN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Koot heq kahnoq yal Vaq ka khơl adro đơu Vaq heq pahnăp ka Koot katul dêh araak. Oot thuôk xuq Vaq, Vaq pahnăp oot ka Koot, ji oot heq jư xok apok Vaq. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Juneq, oot heq xet đaneq dêq hloay tôôy varơuq Vaq heq kahniq ka Koot laa xing Vaq, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />vii Koot heq kahniq ka oot kaluh apok đơu Vaq heq kahniq ka Koot, oot nhonq kaluh apok nưq ji dong dik xet đaneq Koot truh xing Vaq, ji oot tuôq đaneq jơq Vaq heq patăk dăt Koot. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Koot apôôy vôôch ka oot. Koot leh apôôy vôôch ka dêh araak, bơh laa ka khơl adro đơu Vaq heq pahnăp ka Koot, vii oot thuôk xuq Vaq. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Dêq hloay ku Koot laa ku Vaq; kung đaji ku Vaq laa ku Koot, ji Koot jah tađnah tađnaak katul oot. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Koot paq măn đom dêh araak đnoyq, đơu oot măn đom dêh araak, măn Koot xuq dii Vaq. Kuh Vaq Vah, apôôy jư 'yo oot đom yal Vaq đơu Vaq heq kahniq ka Koot, xôq oot hnoq ik vlôh muuyq, đaji Haay. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Đong tuôôy Koot đong măn kung oot, Koot jư 'yo oot đom yal Vaq đơu Vaq heq kahniq ka Koot. Koot heq jư 'yo oot anưq leh muuyq dro leq đom sôôq oot biq hư hlơơp, đêh vlôh dro koot ku varơuq hư hlơơp, xôq apok Rahlăp Vah jah jêêk. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Bơh juneq, Koot xuq dii Vaq, ji koot đnooy kaluh varơuq neq đom dêh araak xôq oot e xuum hlah hlaak ku Koot jah xaleep đom oot. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Koot heq kahniq apok Vaq ka oot, ji manih araak heq 'yarơ oot vii oot leh thuôk xuq dêh araak, kung đaji Koot leh thuôk xuq dêh araak. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Koot leh apôôy vôôch xôq Vaq taway oot vlôh klơlh dêh araak, bơh laa xôq Vaq jư 'yo oot klơlh adro aak. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Oot leh thuôk xuq dêh araak, kung đaji Koot leh thuôk xuq dêh araak. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Apôôy Vaq pa xarêh oot bơơn varơuq dik; apok Vaq laa varơuq dik. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Vaq heq patăk Koot muut đom dêh araak đaleq, yôôych Koot kung patăk oot muut đom dêh araak đanưq. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Vii kơq oot Koot heq kadih dơơp yuôôr vah, xôq kadih oot kung jah vlôh vah đom varơuq dik. <verse eid="JHN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Bơh Koot leh vơ apôôy vôôch ka khơl adro neq, đơu măn ka khơl adro tuôq aduq Koot gamưh apok ku oot đnoyq, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />xôq dêq hloay oot vlôh jêêk muuyq, đaji Vaq đom Koot ji Koot đom Vaq, xôq ka oot kung măn đom Haay, xôq dêh araak tuôq đaneq Vaq heq patăk Koot truh. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Tađnah tađnaak đơu Vaq heq kahniq ka Koot, yôôych Koot kung kahniq ka oot, xôq oot hnoq ik laa muuyq, đaji Haay laa muuyq; <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Koot măn đom oot, ji Vaq măn đom Koot xôq ka oot jah xaleep vlôh jêêk muuyq, xôq dêh araak xet đaneq Vaq heq patăk Koot truh, ji Vaq heq xung xiaq oot đaji Vaq heq xung xiaq Koot. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Vaq lơơy, adro leq đơu Vaq heq pahnăp ka Koot, Koot trôôch đaneq Koot măn 'leq yôôych oot kung măn đnư dii Koot xôq atrêêk 'yo tađnah tađnaak ku Koot, laa tađnah tađnaak Vaq heq kahniq ka Koot, vii Vaq heq xung xiaq Koot adroyq tuôôy panưk pajêêk daak dêh. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Kuh Vaq Hyioh Jăk, long tabơh dêh araak leh xet Vaq, bơh Koot xet vaq; ji khơl adro neq xet đaneq Vaq heq patăk Koot truh. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Koot heq kahnoq yal Vaq ka oot, ji Koot hnoq kahnoq đnoyq, xôq xung xiaq đơu Vaq heq xiaq Koot măn đom oot, ji Koot kung măn đom oot.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Atêq tuôôy đnooy yôôch kaluh apok nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu hooy vlôh dii khơl xatyauq kadraq hlê piik hơq alook daak Kêt-rôn, đơu aduq neq e muuyq hluôôt, Kadraq kung khơl xatyauq kadraq hooy muut đom nưq. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Juneq, Ju-đa, dro xôq vih tachơơl Kadraq, kung xet aduq neq, vii Lôôk Jê-xu ragơy tagumq hlê aduq neq dii khơl xatyauq kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Vii anưq, Ju-đa truh aduq nưq, jarooy tyauq muuyq bing kuun kung bing kuun jư 'yo xing aduq khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji xing khơl manih Pha-ri-si, taway tyauq đeen, đuôôk ji valong xieh. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Tuôôy nưq, vii Lôôk Jê-xu xet tôôy varơuq đong xalih truh ka kadraq, lunưq tuôôy tawaak vlôh, Kadraq vôôch oot: “Êêp kơy axek kơyq?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Oot tơơl hlê Kadraq: “Jê-xu, manih Na-xa-ret.” Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Jơq laa gô.” (Tuôôy nưq, Ju-đa, adro tachơơl Kadraq kung đong dưk kung bing oot.) <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yôôch anưq, tuôôy Kadraq heq đnooy dii oot: “Jơq laa gô,” yôôch oot xaluuy xuq pi atêq ji gưlh pôôt vari. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq laay vôôch oot: “Êêp kơy axek kơyq?” Yôôch oot đnooy: “Jê-xu, manih Na-xa-ret.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl: “Gô heq đnooy dii êêp kơy đaneq jơq laa gô. Lunưq, atoh êêp kơy đong axek gô yôôych dayh ăm khơl adro neq hooy.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />(Nưq laa xôq jah jêêk apok đơu Kadraq heq đnooy đaneq: “Truh khơl adro Vaq heq pahnăp ka Koot, Koot leh dơơp hlơơp muuyq dro leq đom sôôq oot.”) <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy đong e muuyq poop xieh, Si-môn Phi-e-rơ hruut ni vlôh yôôch kathôp dơơp adro xapok ku thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji triet kloh tôôr akoh ku dro neq. Anơng dro xapok laa Man-chu. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yôôch anưq Lôôk Jê-xu dăt Phi-e-rơ: “Dayh viet xieh muut đom kadôh! Dooy đơu Vaq heq kahniq ka thơy, thơy hnoq ik leh duh hôôch ni ih?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Atêq nưq, bing kuun ji adro dưk jarooy kung bing kuun jư 'yo ku manih Jo Thaiq rôp jư Lôôk Jê-xu ji vek Kadraq hlê. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Adroyq dik, oot jarooy Kadraq truh An-ne, vii kơy nưq laa Vaq kadrê ku Kai-phe, đơu Kai-phe laa thơy tơơk tưp kôt đom xanưm nưq. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />(Mot kadrơy, Kai-phe laa manih heq ahluk manih Jo Thaiq đaneq dik laa tolh iaq tuôôy muuyq dro kaxêêt thay ka dêq hloay tamooy.)<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Tuôôy nưq, Si-môn Phi-e-rơ ji muuyq khơl xatyauq kadrơy hooy tyauq Lôôk Jê-xu. Bơh khơl xatyauq nưq 'miêh e qween xet dii thơy tơơk tưp kôt, anưq dro nưq hooy dii Lôôk Jê-xu muut đom chaal hnhư ku thơy tơơk tưp kôt. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Măn Phi-e-rơ măn dưk ka aduq 'mok pi gôk, lunưq khơl xatyauq hơq, laa adro e qween xet dii thơy tơơk tưp kôt, hooy vlôh đnooy dii mư jư 'mok, yôôch jarooy Phi-e-rơ muut. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Atêq nưq, mư xapok, laa manih jư 'mok, đnooy dii Phi-e-rơ: “Be aalq kơy kung măn đom sôôq khơl xatyauq ku manih neq ih?” Kơy tơơl: “Leh aalq gô.” <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl xapok ji bing kuun jư 'yo đong dưk đnư, atuut muuyq đum ôôlh kheng vii plêêk jaleek, ji oot đong kadih kajôôl xatôq. Phi-e-rơ kung măn kung oot, dưk đnư ji kadih kajôôl xatôq.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Tuôôy nưq, thơy tơơk tưp kôt vôôch Lôôk Jê-xu truh khơl xatyauq Kadraq ji truh varơuq pato dayq ku Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê kơy nưq: “Gô heq đnooy trôôk ăm xet ka tôôy dro. Gô hloay pato dayq đom hnhư anguk ji đom hnhư hơu, laa aduq tôôy dro manih Jo Thaiq anguk tagumq kung mamuuyq, ji gô be đnooy kajoq padu kadook dêq. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Aleq kơy vôôch gô? Dayh vôôch khơl adro heq tameng apok đơu gô heq đnooy dii oot. 'Yo hơq, khơl adro nưq xet gô heq đnooy varơuq kajoq.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy đanưq, yôôych muuyq dro đom bing kuun jư 'yo đong dưk đnư ăm Lôôk Jê-xu muuyq pađa, đnooy đaneq: “Kơy tơơl apok thơy tơơk tưp kôt lunưq ih?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl apok ni: “Atoh gô đnooy leh troq, dayh pato vlôh aduq leh troq nưq. Măn atoh laa troq, nưq aleq ay đnayh gô?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Yôôch tuôôy đong măn biq vek, An-ne ăm jarooy Kadraq hooy truh thơy tơơk tưp kôt Kai-phe.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Tuôôy nưq, Si-môn Phi-e-rơ đong măn dưk ji kadih kajôôl. Yôôch anưq, khơl drơy đnooy dii kơy: “Leh aalq kơy kung măn đom sôôq khơl xatyauq ku dro nưq ih?” Kơy leh nhonq ji tơơl: “Leh aalq gô.” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Muuyq dro đom sôôq khơl xapok ku thơy tơơk tưp kôt laa takuul takiel dii manih đơu Phi-e-rơ heq triet kloh tôôr, đnooy: “Be aalq gô heq hloq kơy măn đom hluôôt kung dro nưq ih?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Anưq laa Phi-e-rơ leh nhonq yưk tra đnoyq yôôch vơ hloay jơnưq ier rok.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Atêq nưq, oot jarooy Lôôk Jê-xu xing aduq Kai-phe truh hnhư padrok. (Tuôôy nưq, đong măn xaroq meel, oot leh hooy muut đom hnhư padrok xôq oot leh huq biq klơơr 'yêq, đơu gamưh anưq oot hnoq ik xa Lêh Dalơh Hlê.) <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Lunưq, Phi-lat heq hooy vlôh tavơh oot ji đnooy: “Êêp kơy taway tyauq apok rôp xadrah kajoq tachơơl hlê adro neq?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Oot tơơl hlê ji đnooy dii kơy: “Atoh dro neq leh e dơơp varơuq xơk aak, yôôych 'wot heq be rôp atăq ni ka padrok.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Vii anưq, Phi-lat đnooy dii oot: “Êêp kơy dayh jarooy manih neq xuq yôôch xưh ni tyauq ganuun ku êêp kơy.” Manih Jo Thaiq đnooy dii kơy nưq: “Be e pheep ka 'wot xưh kaxêêt ka adro leq dêq.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />(Nưq laa xôq jah jêêk apok Lôôk Jê-xu, đơu Kadraq heq đnooy xôq pato truh trôôk kaxêêt đaleq Kadraq xarôp pheq chiuq.)<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Anưq laa Phi-lat laay hooy muut đom hnhư padrok, ji dăt taayh Lôôk Jê-xu truh yôôch kơy nưq đnooy dii Kadraq: “Ay e jơq laa Vuua manih Jo Thaiq?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê: “Kơy kadih kơy đnooy varơuq neq long dro leq heq đnooy ka kơy truh gô?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Phi-lat tơơl apok: “Gô lưp aalq laa manih Jo Thaiq 'leq? Kadih manih dêh ku ay ji khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt rôp atăq ay ka gô. Ay heq dơơp varơuq kajoq?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê: “Daak dêh ku gô leh thuôk ku dêh araak neq. Atoh daak dêh ku gô thuôk ku dêh araak neq, yôôych heq đol khơl xapok ku gô heq tahmơt xôq gô leh biq rôp atăq ka manih Jo Thaiq. Bơh juneq daak dêh ku gô be măn aduq neq.” <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Yôôch anưq Phi-lat đnooy dii Kadraq: “Anưq e jơq ay laa vuua?” Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl: “Kơy đnooy đaneq gô laa vuua. Gô heq jah pa iir vlôh vii varơuq neq, ji gô heq truh đom dêh araak kung vii varơuq nưq, nưq laa xôq dơơp xanưk ka varơuq dik, Dro leq thuôk xuq varơuq dik yôôych tameng apok ku gô.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Phi-lat đnooy dii Kadraq: “Varơuq dik laa kajoq?” Đnooy yôôch apok nưq, kơy nưq laay hooy vlôh tavơh manih Jo Thaiq ji đnooy dii oot: “Gô be axek hloq kadrôôp maroh kajoq aduq dro neq. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Lunư, tyauq ganuun ku êêp kơy yôôych gô luh vlôh ka êêp kơy muuyq dro muut katuôôy Lêh Dalơh Hlê. Anưq, êêp kơy trôôch gô luh vlôh Vuua ku manih Jo Thaiq ka êêp kơy be?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Yôôch anưq oot laay pariau tok, đaneq: “Leh aalq dro neq, đơu laa Ba-ra-ba.” Tuôôy nưq, Ba-ra-ba laa muuyq dro atôk.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Anưq, hloay tuôôy nưq, Phi-lat ăm rôp Lôôk Jê-xu ji tiel dook Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Bing kuun taat muuyq đoat vuua bơơn jaliê. Oot ayil tol akoq Kadraq, ji hlưp muut ka Kadraq muuyq poop aau yơơt maau dôôp. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Oot truh kangưưr Kadraq ji đnooy: “Kuh kul Vuua manih Jo Thaiq!” yôôch ăm Kadraq toleq pađa. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Muuyq yưk tra, Phi-lat hooy vlôh ji đnooy dii oot: “'Yo ne, gô jarooy manih neq vlôh ka êêp kơy xôq êêp kơy xet đaneq gô leh axek hloq kadrôôp maroh leq aduq ay nưq.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Yôôch Lôôk Jê-xu hooy vlôh, yil đoat jaliê ji hlưp aau dôôp, Phi-lat đnooy dii oot: “Dayh 'yo manih neq yơu!” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Anưq laa, muut tuôôy khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji bing kuun jư 'yo hloq Kadraq, oot pariau kôt đaneq: “Đongq đing ni tol gay charăk! Đongq đing ni tol gay charăk!” Phi-lat dăt oot: “Êêp kơy dayh kadih rôp ay nưq ji đongq đing, ji gô be axek hloq kadrôôp maroh leq aduq ay nưq.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Manih Jo Thaiq tơơl kung kơy: “'Wot e ganuun ji 'yo tyauq ganuun nưq, yôôych ni pheq kaxêêt vii ni kadih 'yo ni laa Koot Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Kơq nưq, tuôôy Phi-lat tameng apok nưq, kơy nưq kang athêêp yôq varaal, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />kơy laay hooy muut đom hnhư padrok ji đnooy dii Lôôk Jê-xu: “Ay truh xing aduq leq?” Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu leh ăm kơy nưq xet apok tơơl. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Vii anưq, Phi-lat đnooy dii Kadraq: “Ay leh tơơl apok gô ih? Ay leh xet đaneq gô e qwuyen luh vlôh ay, ji kung e qwuyen đongq đing ay tol gay charăk ih?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl hlê kơy nưq: “Kơy be e qwuyen kajoq đôôyq dii gô, atoh qwuyen nưq heq leh jah kahniq ka kơy xing plêêk. Vii kơq nưq, adro rôp atăq gô ka kơy e kadrôôp parêq iaq.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Vii apok nưq, Phi-lat axek trôôk luh vlôh Kadraq, bơh manih Jo Thaiq pariau kôt, đaneq: “Atoh padrok luh ni yôôych padrok leh aalq laa 'wơyq ku Sê-sa. Kơyq kadih vanê ni dơơp vuua laa tachơơl hlê dii Sê-sa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Kơq nưq, atêq tuôôy tameng toleq apok nưq, Phi-lat ăm jarooy Lôôk Jê-xu vlôh pi gôk yôôch kơy 'ngôôy muut ragê xưh xadrah ka aduq jah taayh laa “Hnhư Kanôôp Phơu”; măn đom apok Hi-baq-lai laa “Ga-ba-tha”. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />(Tuôôy nưq laa hngơy ralauq xôq ka Lêh Dalơh Hlê. Tuôôy nưq laa kawah wat thưq drơu.) Kơy nưq đnooy dii manih Jo Thaiq: “'Yo yơu, vuua ku êêp kơy!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Bơh oot pariau kôt: “Kađnok ni tok! Kađnok ni tok! Đongq đing ni tol gay charăk!” Phi-lat vôôch oot: “Gô đongq đing vuua ku êêp kơy ih?” Khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt tơơl: “Đêh vlôh Sê-sa, 'wot leh e vuua.” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Anưq laa, muut tuôôy nưq, kơy nưq pahnăp Kadraq ka oot xôq chiuq đongq đing tol gay charăk, yôôch oot rôp Lôôk Jê-xu ji jarooy hooy.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Tuôôy pheq kadih hlôôy gay charăk, Kadraq hooy truh aduq jah taayh laa “Aduq Kadah”, aduq nưq đom apok Hi-baq-lai jah taayh laa “Gô-gô-tha.” <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Khơl drơy đongq đing Kadraq aduq nưq, kung dii Kadraq laa vaarq dro kadrơy, măn pi neq ji pi hơq, măn Lôôk Jê-xu măn katul. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Tuôôy nưq, Phi-lat kung ăm valơk muuyq riak chư yôôch đongq tol gay charăk. Riak chư jah valơk: JÊ-XU MANIH NA-XA-RET, VUUA TAMOOY JO THAIQ. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Kơq nưq, 'ngưng manih Jo Thaiq heq đok riak chư nưq vii aduq đơu Lôôk Jê-xu biq đongq đing laa jeq theng phôq. Riak chư jah valơk bơơn apok Hi-baq-lai, apok La-tinh ji apok Hi Lap. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Vii anưq, khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt manih Jo Thaiq đnooy dii Phi-lat: “Apôôy te valơk laa ‘Vuua tamooy Jo Thaiq,’ đơu valơk laa ‘Adro đnooy đaneq “Gô laa Vuua tamooy Jo Thaiq.”’” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Phi-lat tơơl: “Apok gô heq valơk yôôych gô heq valơk yôôch.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Atêq nưq, muut tuôôy bing kuun đongq đing Lôôk Jê-xu muut gay charăk, oot xok qwuân aau ku Kadraq yôôch ahlook dơơp poot phon — tôôy dro kuun muuyq phon — ji aau yơơt, Aau nưq yôôych leh e trôôk axit, laa muuyq tômq vaayh tabich xing taalh pôôt 'laarq. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Vii anưq, oot đnooy dii mamuuyq: “Te chieh aau vlôh, bơh dayh palăk truh ni, 'yo ni hnoq laa ku kơyq.” Nưq laa xôq apok Rahlăp Vah jah jêêk đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Oot ahlook mamuuyq qwuân aau gô,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">palăk xok aau gô.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Anưq laa, bing kuun heq dơơp đanưq.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl manih đong dưk gah gay charăk ku Lôôk Jê-xu laa miq ku Kadraq ji oh ay ku miq Kadraq, nưq laa Ma-ri kadrê ku Kơ-lê-ô-ba, kung Ma-ri Ma-đơ-len. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Anưq laa, tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu 'yo hloq miq kadraq ji khơl xatyauq đơu kadraq xiaq dưk gah nưq, yôôych Kadraq đnooy dii miq: “Nee mo lơơy, 'yo hơq, koot kanau ku mo!” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii khơl xatyauq: “'Yo hơq, miq ku ay!” Xing tuôôy nưq, khơl xatyauq nưq jarooy mo xuq hnhư ni.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Atêq nưq, vii Lôôk Jê-xu xet đaneq tôôy varơuq heq jah payôôch yôôch, lunưq xôq apok Rahlăp Vah, jah jêêk, yôôych Kadraq đnooy: “Gô thaal.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Muuyq poop wo tađnưk viik daak jôômq jah xôq ka đnư, vii anưq, bơơn kach vagiep muut gay baai hương muuyq buuy 'nhuuy tahli viik daak jôômq, oot palo tok ka huuy Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Anưq, tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu nhemq daak jôômq nưq, yôôych Kadraq đnooy: “Tôôy varơuq heq jah xaleep!” Yôôch xagul akoq pôôt, Kadraq truut phool hiel kadraq.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Atêq nưq, vii hngơy nưq laa hngơy ralauq xôq, lunưq xôq kaluh xaak manih leh kưq măn tol gay charăk tuôôt hngơy Sa-bat (vii hngơy Sa-bat nưq laa muuyq hngơy 'yo kôt), manih Jo Thaiq vôôch Phi-lat xôq jah dơơp tagôh atu jôôk ku khơl dro nưq yôôch kaluh xaak hnoq ik tơq hooy. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Vii anưq, bing kuun hooy truh ji tiel tagôh xakook jôôk ku adro droyq dik, yôôch ku adro thưq vaarq, laa khơl adro biq đongq đing kung dii Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Bơh tuôôy truh aduq Lôôk Jê-xu, oot hloq Kadraq heq kaxêêt yôôch, lunưq leh tiel tagôh jôôk Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Lunư, muuyq dro đom bing kuun viit kapiik khiêk jamiir Kadraq bơơn maak, vơ hloay vahaap ji daak hoot vlôh. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Adro heq hloq varơuq nưq heq dơơp xanưk hlê, ji apok xanưk ku adro neq laa dong dik. Dro nưq xet đaneq ni đnooy varơuq dik, xôq oh ay kung tuôq. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Vii kaluh varơuq nưq heq xalih vlôh xôq dơơp jah jêêk apok Rahlăp Vah: “Be muuyq khiêk leq ku Kadraq hnoq biq tagôh.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Muuyq aduq kadrơy đom Rahlăp Vah laay đnooy: “Oot hnoq 'yo tok Kơy đơu oot heq viit.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, Jô-sep manih thuôk A-ri-ma-thê, laa muuyq khơl xatyauq ku Lôôk Jê-xu (bơh kadook vii yôq manih Jo Thaiq), kơy vôôch Phi-lat xôq xagook xaak Lôôk Jê-xu hooy. Phi-lat ăm pheep. Anưq, kơy truh ji xagook xaak Kadraq hooy. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Ni-kô-đem kung truh — Kơy laa adro tuôôy adroyq truh tavơh Lôôk Jê-xu đom ka klôôy — taway tyauq kaluh jor jơu thơơm ji bôôt gay lô hôôyq, đom kơh muuyq hreek kiq La-mah. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Anưq oot xagook xaak Lôôk Jê-xu hooy ji ahnom xaak bơơn vaayh lanh kung dii jarơơu thơơm, nưq laa tyauq ganuun ku manih Jo Thaiq xôq ahnom xaak. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Mot kadrơy, ka aduq đơu Kadraq biq đongq đing e muuyq hluôôt, ji đom hluôôt e muuyq xanưng đơơu, đơu đom nưq koq lưp e kơyq hmưq jah up. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Lunưq, vii kơq hngơy ralauq xôq ku manih Jo Thaiq ji vii xanưng yôôych măn jeq, anưq oot up xôq Lôôk Jê-xu aduq nưq.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Xaroq meel hngơy adroyq dik đom twuân, tuôôy dêh măn kamơng, Ma-ri Ma-đơ-len hooy truh xanưng ji hloq kuk phơu heq biq palanh klơlh 'mok xanưng. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Lunưq, mư charơơk hooy ji truh kung Si-môn Phi-e-rơ kung dii khơl xatyauq hơq, laa manih Lôôk Jê-xu xiaq, yôôch mư đnooy ka oot: “Khơl drơy heq xagook Lôôk vlôh klơlh xanưng, ji 'wot leh xet oot xôq Kadraq aduq leq.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Anưq laa Phi-e-rơ ji khơl xatyauq hơq vlôh pi gôk ji hooy truh xanưng. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Dêq baarq kung charơơk hooy, đơu khơl xatyauq hơq charơơk kalh iaq Phi-e-rơ ji truh aduq xanưng adroyq. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Atêq tuôôy kadônq pôôt 'yo, dro nưq 'yo hloq kaluh apek vaayh lanh măn đnư, bơh leh muut pi 'lăp. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Atêq nưq, Si-môn Phi-e-rơ, tyauq atêq dro nưq, kung truh aduq, kơy hooy muut đom xanưng. Kơy 'yo hloq kaluh apek vaayh lanh măn đnư, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />măn khanh jah ahnom tol akoq Kadraq yôôych leh măn muuyq aduq dii kaluh apek vaayh lanh, đơu jah gup hlê xôq đêh muuyq aduq. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Yôôch anưq, tuôôy nưq, khơl xatyauq hơq, laa adro hooy truh aduq xanưng adroyq, kung tawaak muut, dro nưq 'yo hloq ji tuôq. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Vii oot kung koq lưp hlolh apok Rahlăp Vah truh varơuq Kadraq pheq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Atêq nưq, vaarq dro khơl xatyauq laay wiit xuq aduq ku baarq.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Măn Ma-ri yôôych dưk nhim măn pi gôk xanưng. Yôôch mư vơơ nhim, vơơ moq 'yo muut đom xanưng. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Mư hloq vaarq kơy yaak dii qwuân aau ko tađnah đong 'ngôôy ka aduq xôq xaak Lôôk Jê-xu, muuyq kơy măn pi akoq, ji muuyq kơy măn pi jôôk. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Khơl kơy nưq vôôch mư: “Nee mư, aleq mư nhim?” Mư tơơl apok oot: “Vii khơl drơy xagook Lôôk gô hooy, ji gô leh xet oot xôq Kadraq aduq leq.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Đnooy toleq apok nưq yôôch, mư wiit xăk xuq pi atêq yôôych hloq Lôôk Jê-xu heq dưk đnư, đơu mư leh xet đaneq nưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii mư: “Nee mư, aleq mư nhim? Mư đong axek kơyq?” Vii mư biit đaneq nưq laa manih dơơp hluôôt, anưq mư đnooy: “Kơy lơơy, atoh kơy heq xagook Kadraq hooy, xiin đnooy ka gô aduq đơu kơy xôq Kadraq, yôôch gô hnoq xagook Kadraq hooy.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Lôôk Jê-xu taayh mư: “Ma-ri.” Tuôôy wih hlê, mư tơơl dii Kadraq bơơn apok Hi-baq-lai: “Ra-bu-ni” (apok nưq e iq laa: “Thơy”). <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii mư: “Te bôk truh thơy, vii thơy koq lưp hooy tok kung Vaq 'leq; bơh dayh hooy tavơh oh ay ku thơy ji đnooy dii oot đaneq ‘thơy hnoq hooy tok kung Vaq thơy kung laa Vaq ku oh ay, ji Kơy Plêêk ku thơy kung laa Kơy Plêêk ku oh ay.’” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Ma-ri Ma-đơ-len hooy, taboon hlê ka khơl xatyauq đaneq: “Gô heq hloq Lôôk,” ji kaluh apok Kadraq heq xanoh ka mư.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Atêq nưq, đong tuôôy rayôôp klôôy đom hngơy nưq, laa hngơy droyq dik đom twuân lêh, ji kaluh 'mok ka aduq đơu khơl xatyauq măn raay biq kađip hlê vii yôq manih Jo Thaiq, yôôych Lôôk Jê-xu truh ji dưk măn katul oot ji Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Hrok hrol ka oh ay.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Đnooy apok nưq yôôch, Kadraq ăm oot 'yo vaarq ti ji piik jamiir ku kadraq. Tuôôy nưq, khơl xatyauq raay jah hlah hlaak tuôôy 'yo hloq Lôôk. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq laay đnooy dii oot: “Hrok hrol ka oh ay. Vaq heq patăk dăt thơy đaleq, yôôych thơy kung patăk dăt oh ay lunưq.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ji atêq tuôôy đnooy apok nưq, Kadraq klôôp hơơy tol oot ji dăt oot: “Dayh nhonq xok Kơy Phool Hiel. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Long adro leq đơu oh ay ka'lăk kadrôôp, yôôych kadrôôp oot jah ka'lăk; long adro leq đơu oh ay jư hlê, yôôych kadrôôp oot biq jư hlê.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Bơh Thô-ma, muuyq đom kưl vaarq dro khơl xatyauq, kơy jah taayh laa Đi-đim, leh măn kung dii oot tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu truh. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Lunưq, khơl xatyauq kadrơy đnooy dii kơy: “'Wot heq hloq Lôôk.” Bơh kơy đnooy dii oot: “Atoh gô leh hloq hlêêl đing tol ti Kadraq, ji xôq lôk ti gô muut hlêêl đing, kung đaji vêq ti gô muut piik jamiir Kadraq, yôôych gô kajưk dik hnoq leh tuôq.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Thơơm hngơy atêq khơl xatyauq Kadraq laay măn đom hnhư, ji Thô-ma măn kung oot. Tuôôy kaluh 'mok raay biq kađip riit, Lôôk Jê-xu truh ji dưk măn katul yôôch Kadraq đnooy: “Hrok hrol ka oh ay.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Xatyauq nưq, Kadraq dăt Thô-ma: “Dayh xôq lôk ti ay muut đnen đơu 'yo pla ti thơy. Ji dayh xok ti ay xôq muut piik jamiir thơy. Te liq găk xuum, bơh dayh tuôq.” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Thô-ma tơơl hlê ji tơơl dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk gô ji Kơy Plêêk gô.” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Kơq vii ay heq hloq Thơy, lunưq ay tuôq. Vanong ka adro leq koq lưp hloq đơu tuôq.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Atêq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu kung dơơp 'ngưng pheep akêh kadrơy kangưưr khơl xatyauq Kadraq, đơu kaluh varơuq nưq yôôych leh jah valơk xôq đom rahlăp neq; <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />măn kaluh varơuq neq jah valơk hlê laa xôq oh ay tuôq đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, Koot Kơy Plêêk, ji xôq oh ay e jah varơuq riirh tuôôy tuôq aduq yal Kadraq.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu laay kahnoq kadih xăk ka khơl xatyauq aduq Tahli Ti-bê-ri-at. Kadraq heq kahnoq xăk vlôh đaji luneq: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />toleq dro khơl xatyauq măn kung mamuuyq — Si-môn Phi-e-rơ, Thô-ma, jah taayh laa Đi-đim, Na-tha-na-ên, manih thuôk Ka-na đom dêh Ga-li-lê, kung khơl koot kanau ku Xê-bê-đê, ji vaarq dro kadrơy đom bing khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Si-môn Phi-e-rơ đnooy dii oot: “Gô hooy rôp kaa.” Oot đnooy dii kơy: “'Wot kung hooy dii ay.” Oot hooy vlôh ji tawaak tok muuyq poop ge, đơu oot heq leh rôp jah kajoq đom klôôy nưq. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq laa xaroq meel yôôch, Lôôk Jê-xu dưk tol gah tahli, long anưq, khơl xatyauq leh xet đaneq nưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Anưq yôôch Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Êêp koot lơơy, leh e kaa kajoq xôq xa ih?” Oot tơơl apok Kadraq: “Lưp.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Bơh Kadraq dăt oot: “Dayh qweek lươyq vlôh pi akoh ge, yôôych êêp ay hnoq axek jah kaa.” Anưq, oot qweek lươyq đơu leh e paraat xôq duuy ni tok vii sôôq kaa thier 'ngưng. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Atêq nưq, khơl xatyauq hơq, laa adro đơu Lôôk Jê-xu xiaq, đnooy dii Phi-e-rơ: “Nưq laa Lôôk.” Anưq laa, atêq tuôôy Si-môn Phi-e-rơ tameng đaneq nưq laa Lôôk, yôôych gwonq aau gôk rawiit xăk (vii kơy đong măn xăk vok), yôôch katruyh xăk pôôt tahli. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Măn khơl xatyauq kadrơy yôôych hooy tol ge (vii oot măn kach gah tahli leh xangưưy, vơ đom kaplah vaarq hreek ku-đê), duuy tyauq lươyq viik kaa. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Atêq nưq, muut tuôôy oot pôôt ge tok gah, oot hloq đum ôôlh kheng đong jaq, kaa ji e tôôp đong vuh tol nưq. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Lôôk Jê-xu dăt oot: “Dayh taway muuyq axit đom sôôq kaa đơu oh ay đơơu rôp jah truh đnen.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Vii anưq, Si-môn Phi-e-rơ hooy tok ji duuy lươyq muut gah, viik ngăk muuyq hreek dăp kưl pe poop kaa kôt. Ji long e thier 'ngưng kaa, lươyq heq leh biq hyaak. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Dayh truh đnen xa waal xaroq”. Mot kadrơy, be kơyq đom khơl xatyauq hôôk vôôch Kadraq: “Kơy laa kơyq?” Oot raay heq xet đaneq nưq laa Lôôk. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Lôôk Jê-xu tawaak truh yôôch xok tôôp ji palo ka oot, dii kaa kung anưq. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Neq heq laa yưk thưq pe Lôôk Jê-xu kahnoq xăk vlôh ka khơl xatyauq, xing tuôôy Kadraq jah riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Yôôch tuôôy oot heq xa waal xaroq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii Si-môn Phi-e-rơ: “Si-môn, koot ku Jăng, ay xiaq thơy iaq kaluh varơuq neq be?” Kơy đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, jơq, Kadraq xet đaneq gô xiaq Kadraq.” Kadraq đnooy dii kơy: “Dayh văch xiap kaluh trưưu koot ku thơy.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Kadraq laay đnooy dii kơy yưk thưq vaarq: “Si-môn, koot ku Jăng, ay xiaq thơy be?” Kơy tơơl apok Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, e, Kadraq xet đaneq gô xiaq Kadraq,” Kadraq đnooy dii kơy: “Dayh xakaq jư trưưu ku thơy.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Kadraq đnooy kung kơy yưk thưq pe: “Si-môn, koot ku Jăng, ay xiaq thơy be?” Phi-e-rơ hlu rơu vii Kadraq vôôch kơy yưk thưq pe: “Ay xiaq thơy be?” Kơy tơơl dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, Kadraq xet dêq tôôy varơuq; Kadraq xet đaneq gô xiaq Kadraq.” Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Dayh văch xiap trưưu ku thơy. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Dong dik, dong dik, thơy đnooy dii ay, tuôôy ay măn blaay, ay kadih ay hnek katêêk ji hooy aduq leq ay trôôch, bơh tuôôy ay karaq, ay hnoq yaalh ti ay vlôh, ji dro kadrơy hnoq hnek katêêk ka ay yôôch jarooy truh aduq đơu ay leh trôôch.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Kadraq đnooy varơuq nưq, xôq pato varơuq kaxêêt luleq đơu kơy hnoq dơơp tađnah tađnaak Kơy Plêêk. Đnooy apok nưq yôôch, Kadraq dăt kơy: “Dayh tyauq thơy.” <verse eid="JHN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Tuôôy wih hlê, Phi-e-rơ hloq khơl xatyauq đơu Lôôk Jê-xu xiaq đong hooy tyauq atêq, laa adro đom waal xa klôôy heq ganưq muut tada Kadraq yôôch vôôch: “Kuh Lôôk, kơyq laa adro xalih xuum Kadraq?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Vii anưq, tuôôy hloq dro nưq, phi-e-rơ đnooy dii Lôôk Jê-xu: “Kuh Lôôk, măn dro neq hnoq luleq?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Atoh thơy trôôch dro neq kưq măn hlê dong truh tuôôy thơy truh, yôôych e tajinq kajoq truh ay? Ay dayh tyauq thơy.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Nưq laa apok neq pahêêr vlôh đom katul khơl oh ay đaneq khơl xatyauq nưq hnoq leh kaxêêt. Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu leh đnooy dii kơy đaneq dro nưq hnoq leh kaxêêt, bơh laa: “Atoh thơy trôôch dro nưq kưq măn hlê dong truh tuôôy thơy truh, yôôych e tajinq kajoq truh ay.”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Neq jơq laa khơl xatyauq dơơp xanưk truh kaluh varơuq neq, ji laa manih valơk hlê kaluh varơuq nưq, đơu haay xet đaneq apok xanưk ku dro nưq laa dong dik. <verse eid="JHN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Iaq đnoyq, kung e 'ngưng varơuq kadrơy đơu Lôôk Jê-xu heq dơơp, truh kaluh varơuq nưq, atoh valơk xôq dêq tôôy varơuq, yôôych gô biit đaneq dêq ka dêh araak pheq đnooy leh đu aduq xôq dêq kaluh rahlăp jah valơk vlôh.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>